Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我躺在退伍军人医院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was lying there in the VA hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对着我一生最大的不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a big hole blown through the middle of my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始做一些有关于飞翔的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started having these dreams of flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.79,0:00:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由地飞翔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.47,0:00:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 你总有醒来的一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later, though, you always have to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.81,0:01:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你有钱的话 他们可以帮你把脊髓医好\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can fix a spinal, if you got the money,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.82,0:01:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但单靠那点退伍军人的抚恤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not on vet benefits,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不可能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}not in this economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.11,0:01:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次VA检查再加12美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}A VA check and 12 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有一杯咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}will get you a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.49,0:01:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是他们所称的轮候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm what they call… waitlisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.71,0:01:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些孟加拉虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bengal Tiger,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.51,0:01:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭绝了差不多一个世纪后又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}extinct for over a century is making a comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.30,0:01:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些在北京动物园的克隆品\N{\fnArial\fs30}These cloned tiger cubs at the Beijing Zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.35,0:01:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经是那个物种剩下的最后几只了\N{\fnArial\fs30}are the latest of a number of species.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在最近五年又被克隆回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that have been cloned back into existence in the past five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.51,0:01:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为了锻炼自己而加入了海军陆战队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I became a marine for the hardship. To be hammered on the anvil of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.10,0:01:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直告诉自己别人做到的事我也一定能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told myself I can pass any test a man can pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:02:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克！杰克！杰克！杰克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake! Jake! Jake! Jake! Jake!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们直话直说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get it straight, upfront.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.70,0:02:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要你的同情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want your pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.71,0:02:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要一个公平的交易 你来错星球了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a fair deal, you're on the wrong planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,弱肉强食\N{\fnArial\fs30}The strong prey on the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just the way things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.01,0:02:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且没人会在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nobody does a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.32,0:02:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开！ 离他远点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off! Get off of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想为了应该奋斗的事而奋斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I ever wanted in my sorry-ass life was a single thing worth fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.43,0:03:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚又令你自己失去了一个顾客\N{\fnArial\fs30}you just lost yourself a customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,娘娘腔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candy-ass bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.81,0:03:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不下雨的话 我们就不训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it ain't raining, we ain't training.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.45,0:03:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那看起来不像他 - 是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It doesn't look like him. - It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.87,0:03:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是杰克·萨利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Jake Sully?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.21,0:03:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,离远点 你扫了我的兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step off. You're ruining my good mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是关于你哥哥的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找汤米·萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for Sully, T.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.68,0:03:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.83,0:04:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,弱肉强食\N{\fnArial\fs30}The strong prey on the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.54,0:04:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个拿枪的家伙结束了他的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}A guy with a knife took all Tommy would ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.80,0:04:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为了他口袋里的几张钞票\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the paper in his wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.43,0:04:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心里充满了伤感\N{\fnArial\fs30}The concern of the suits was touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.85,0:04:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的哥哥参与了我们一个重要投资计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother represented a significant investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想找你接手完成他的合同\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like to talk to you about taking over his contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们有着相同的基因组\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since your genome is identical to his,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.13,0:04:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们认为你可以继续他的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could step into his shoes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.86,0:04:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将会是一个新的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be a fresh start.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个新的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.03,0:04:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会改头换面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could do something important. You can make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,报酬也很丰厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the pay is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:04:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常丰厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.75,0:05:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米才是科学家 我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy was the scientist, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.25,0:05:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是那种可以飞到数光年远的外太空去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the one who wanted to get shot light-years out in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.76,0:05:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找真理的那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find the answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.05,0:05:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我只是个笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, I was just another dumb grunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞向一个自己将会后悔前往的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting sent someplace he was gonna regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,人在低温睡眠时不会作梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}In cryo, you don't dream at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.97,0:05:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种感觉不像是过了六年\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't feel like six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,比较像是喝了五杯龙舌兰后打过一架的宿醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like a fifth of tequila and an ass-kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们到了 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're there, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.78,0:06:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.87,0:06:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经在低温睡眠状态中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been in cryo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.75,0:06:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺了五年九个月二十二天\N{\fnArial\fs30}for five years, nine months and 22 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会感到饥饿 也会感到虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be hungry. You will be weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.58,0:06:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你觉得恶心想吐 请使用呕吐袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you feel nausea, please use the sacks provided for your convenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.01,0:06:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作人员会非常感谢你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The staff thanks you in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.52,0:06:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面就是潘多拉星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up ahead was Pandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,从小就听说过它 但是从没想过会去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You grew up hearing about it, but I never figured I'd be going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,「女战神号」航天飞机 回复…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valkyrie 1-6, copy…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,「女战神号」航天飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valkyrie 1-6,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以在2-2-4-niner脱轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are clear for de-orbit burn at 2-2-4-niner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.89,0:07:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 准备在2-2-4-niner脱轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, Venture Star. Go for de-orbit burn at 2-2-4-niner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.25,0:07:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戴上滤气面罩！ 都戴上！ - 戴上滤气面罩！ 都戴上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Exo-packs on! Let's go! Exo-packs on! - Exo-packs on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得记住 没有滤气面罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, people, you lose that mask,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将会在二十秒后昏厥 四分钟内死亡！\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're unconscious in 20 seconds, you're dead in four minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不准今天给我死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's nobody be dead today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会让我的报告很难看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks very bad on my report.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.59,0:07:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱大门塔台 飞行器准备降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell's Gate tower, this is TAV 1-6 on approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿越外界线 矿场进入视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crossing outer marker. Mine is in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,松开安全带 拿好你们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harnesses off! Get your packs!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.43,0:08:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,都给我准备好 快点！动作快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it together, let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.62,0:08:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟 准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harnesses off! One minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,舷梯落下后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When that ramp comes down,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接进去基地里 别停下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}go directly into the base. Do not stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.07,0:08:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接跑过去 听我的口令！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go straight inside. Wait for my mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走 走！ 快点出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续向前！ 快走 不要停下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving! Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.13,0:09:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有所谓的前海军陆战队员\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing as an ex-Marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许退役了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may be out,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你永远不会忘记军人那股精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you never lose the attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 特殊人士 别让我等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, special case! Do not make me wait for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 喔 小妞们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.07,0:09:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这群菜鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all this fresh meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地球上 这些人都是军人 陆战队员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back on Earth, these guys were Army dogs, Marines,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为自由而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}fighting for freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:09:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 轮椅男！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out, hot rod!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.09,0:10:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在这里 他们只是佣兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}But out here they're just hired guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿钱替私人企业办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking the money, working for the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吃闲饭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meals on wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧 这也太扯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, that is just wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.40,0:10:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十分钟后会有两个人有空！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got two guys free in about 20 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 我需要他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it! Need them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.58,0:10:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经不在堪萨斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not in Kansas anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.29,0:10:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是「潘多拉」星球 女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are on Pandora, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要时时刻刻记住这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respect that fact every second of every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果世界上真的有地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is a hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在游历过潘多拉后你可能会想去地狱休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might want to go there for some R&R after a tour on Pandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那道围墙后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out there, beyond that fence,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.39,0:10:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何活的东西 不论是天上飞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}every living thing that crawls,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是地上爬的 土里钻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}flies or squats in the mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.81,0:10:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,都想把你生吞活剥地吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}wants to kill you and eat your eyes for Jujubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有一个原生的种族\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an indigenous population of humanoids.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们称其为「纳威人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}called the Na'vi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们喜欢在弓箭上涂上一种神经毒素\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're fond of arrows dipped in a neurotoxin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意可以让你的心跳在一分钟内停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}that'll stop your heart in one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有着天生的强化碳纤维骨骼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they have bones reinforced with naturally occurring carbon fiber.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常难杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are very hard to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,做为你们的安保长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}As head of security,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.68,0:11:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的职责就是保障你们每一个人都活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is my job to keep you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.22,0:11:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.18,0:11:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少不可能成功保住每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们想活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wish to survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.81,0:11:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一定要有坚毅的态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need to cultivate a strong mental attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.48,0:11:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须遵守规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to obey the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.48,0:11:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,「潘多拉规则」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pandora rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,规则一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rule number one…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都比不上这种老掉牙的训话\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing like an old-school safety brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,能令人安心\N{\fnArial\fs30}to put your mind at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.33,0:11:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉 杰克 你是杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Excuse me. Jake! You're Jake,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗 汤米的双胞胎弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}right? Tom's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.54,0:11:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 你长得跟他一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! You look just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.88,0:11:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我是诺姆·斯贝尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I'm Norm. Spellman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾和他一起接受「阿凡达」计划的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went through avatar training with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.72,0:12:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是生物实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}…into the bio-lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.43,0:12:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将会在这里待很久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna spend a lot of time up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.27,0:12:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你好 我是诺姆 阿凡达操作员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! How you doing? Norm, avatar driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是连结室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Link… Here's the link room right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在这里连结上阿凡达\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where we're connecting to the avatar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.15,0:12:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和诺姆会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Norm are here to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.27,0:12:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,远程控制这些叫「阿凡达」的生命体\N{\fnArial\fs30}these remotely controlled bodies called avatars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种用人类基因结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're grown from human DNA mixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.77,0:12:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威人的基因培育出来的生命体\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the DNA of the natives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.66,0:12:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 欢迎 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. Welcome. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.70,0:12:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到潘多拉 很高兴你们能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Pandora. Good to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.26,0:12:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 他们真大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn! They got big.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 在我们飞行时他们已经完全成熟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they fully mature on the flight out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.67,0:12:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来本体感知模拟器运作非常顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the proprioceptive sims seem to work really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.09,0:12:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他们肌肉相当发达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they've got great muscle tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.05,0:12:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还得花几个小时为他们准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take us a few hours to get them decanted,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.97,0:12:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过明天你们就能操控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you guys can take them out tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.47,0:12:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 诺姆·斯贝尔曼博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Dr. Norm Spellman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.14,0:12:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯·佩特尔博士 很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Max Patel. Great to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.25,0:12:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to meet you, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,长得很像他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,长得也很像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it looks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 这是你的阿凡达了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your avatar now, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.84,0:13:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个计划的概念是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the concept is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.47,0:13:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,每位操作员都能连结自己专属的阿凡达\N{\fnArial\fs30}that every driver is matched to his own avatar,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.31,0:13:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的神经系统就能协调一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that their nervous systems are in tune,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,资源开发管理总署之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.27,0:13:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们找我的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why they offered me the gig,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.39,0:13:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我能连结汤米的阿凡达\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I can link with Tommy's avatar,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.74,0:13:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿凡达的造价惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is insanely expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把所有事全部录下来就对了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just say whatever to the video log?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.91,0:13:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你要习惯记录所有的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we gotta get in the habit of documenting everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.16,0:13:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何我们看到的 感觉到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, what we see, what we feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.29,0:13:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是科学研究的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all part of the science.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.69,0:13:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,详细的观察对研究很有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And good science is good observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.08,0:13:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这样可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus it'll help to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.79,0:14:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你在今后的六年里避免精神错乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep you sane for the next six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.34,0:14:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.05,0:14:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.18,0:14:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行科学研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}doing science.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,操作员要出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.52,0:14:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 操作员出舱中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention. Drivers coming out of link.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.57,0:14:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的工作服呢？ 谁看见她的工作服？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the lab coat? Where's the lab coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.37,0:14:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁拿走我的该死的香烟啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's got my goddamn cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我这样子有不对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys! What's wrong with this picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.87,0:14:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.87,0:14:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝·奥古斯汀是一位传奇人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace Augustine is a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.38,0:14:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是阿凡达计划的带头人 她写了本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the head of the Avatar Program. She wrote the book,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.96,0:14:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说那本有关潘多拉植物学的著作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, literally wrote the book on Pandoran botany.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为她对植物的兴趣可能比对人还多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's 'cause she likes plants better than people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.59,0:14:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位就是了 灰姑娘参加完舞会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here she is, Cinderella back from the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.55,0:14:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝我来给你介绍一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace, I'd like you to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.24,0:14:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺姆·斯贝尔曼和杰克·萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norm Spellman and Jake Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:14:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺姆 听说你很优秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norm. I hear good things about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的纳威话学得怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your Na'vi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.73,0:15:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿万灵之母…\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the All Mother…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝福我们的初次见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}…smile upon our first meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.19,0:15:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错 但太拘谨了点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad. You sound a little formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我学了五年…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I studied for five years…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还有很多东西要学\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but there is much to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝 这位是杰克·萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace? This is Jake Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.00,0:15:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁 我要的是你哥哥 不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. I know who you are, and I don't need you. I need your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 那位已经为这个项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the PhD who trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.37,0:15:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,培训整整三年的哲学博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}for three years for this mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.05,0:15:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.17,0:15:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这给所有人带来了巨大的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's a big inconvenience for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在实验室受过什么训练 - 解剖过一次青蛙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much lab training have you had? - I dissected a frog once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.31,0:15:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 看吧 他们现在摆明就是要整我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? You see? I mean, they're just pissing on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,都懒得遮掩\N{\fnArial\fs30}without even the courtesy of calling it rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.98,0:15:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要去找塞弗里奇 - 不 格蕾丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going to Selfridge. - No, Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.31,0:15:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为这是好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.14,0:15:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 这简直是在胡闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man, this is such bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去给他一点颜色瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kick his corporate butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他休想在我的部门搞鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has no business sticking his nose in my department.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.45,0:15:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天早上八点到这里 注意一下你的用词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here tomorrow, 0800. Try and use big words.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝎子二号攻击机 这是地狱之门塔台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scorpion Two-Hotel, Hell's Gate tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.14,0:16:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以从南面起飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are cleared for south departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.51,0:16:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用Ｄ跑道滑行 身份确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hover taxi, Delta runway. Squawk ident.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看见没？ - 看见了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You see that? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有 你在看监视器\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you didn't. You were looking at the monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.73,0:16:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死这支球杆了 罗尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love this putter, Ronnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.58,0:16:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死这支球杆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love this putter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.52,0:16:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克 我原本以为这只是一时的疏忽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker, you know, I used to think it was benign neglect,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我现在明白了 你根本就是在故意整我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but now I see that you're intentionally screwing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝 你知道 我很爱跟你小聊一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace, you know, I enjoy our little talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要的是科学家 不是退役的陆战队员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a researcher. Not some jarhead dropout.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.33,0:16:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 我倒觉得我们能找到他算很幸运的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, I thought we got lucky with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.09,0:16:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 幸运 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lucky? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算哪门子的幸运？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is this in any way lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.80,0:16:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸亏你的科学家有个双胞胎弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky your guy had a twin brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.63,0:16:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,更庆幸的是 还好他不是什么牙医师之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and lucky that brother wasn't some oral hygienist or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.89,0:16:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是一位很有用处的陆战队员\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Marine we can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经指派他作你小组的护卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm assigning him to your team as security escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.56,0:17:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在最不需要的就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last thing I need is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.94,0:17:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,多一个喜欢扣板机的白痴在我这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}another trigger-happy moron out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.10,0:17:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 听着 你的任务就是要赢得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, look, you're supposed to be winning the hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些土著的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the minds of the natives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这难道不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that the whole point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.63,0:17:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那可笑的玩偶剧存在的唯一原因吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your little puppet show?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.15,0:17:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你装扮得像他们 讲话也像他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you look like them and you talk like them,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.69,0:17:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们也应该就会开始信任我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}then they'll start trusting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.48,0:17:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们帮他们建立学校 教他们说人类语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}We build them a school, we teach them English,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.53,0:17:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果呢 这么多年过去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but after, what, how many years?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,关系却越搞越糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relations with the indigenous are only getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.24,0:17:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是因为你用机关枪对着他们的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that tends to happen when you use machine guns on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.79,0:17:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't… I can't…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.79,0:17:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们来这里的原因 超导矿石\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why we're here. Unobtanium.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.84,0:17:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这颗小小的灰色石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this little gray rock sells.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.58,0:17:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,每公斤价值两千万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}for 20 million a kilo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.01,0:17:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是唯一的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.20,0:17:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个靠东西养活我们这里所有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what pays for the whole party.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是靠它来支撑你的科学研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what pays for your science.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在那群土著 正在防碍着我们的采矿作业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, those savages are threatening our whole operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.77,0:17:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正处于随时会开战的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're on the brink of war,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你的任务就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.15,0:17:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我们找一个外交途径的解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}finding a diplomatic solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就尽你所能 给我拿出个成果来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So use what you've got, and get me some results.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.83,0:18:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有多长时间的操作经验？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how much link time have you logged?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.41,0:18:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大约五百二十个小时 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About 520 hours. - That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.13,0:18:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那里 你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in there. You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.41,0:18:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有多长时间的操作经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much have you logged?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,零 但我有读过说明书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zip. But I read a manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是在说笑的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 我自己可以搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.86,0:18:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你认为你可以不经过任何训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you just figured you'd come out here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.49,0:18:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,来到人类已知的最恶劣的环境里\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the most hostile environment known to man,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,既没参加过任何训练也没看过它是怎么运行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with no training of any kind, and see how it went?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.04,0:18:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑袋里到底在想什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was going through your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.45,0:18:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我只是讨厌别人一直告诉我什么不能做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I was sick of doctors telling me what I couldn't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.38,0:18:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命反应良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biometrics are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,三号连接舱已准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Link three is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.13,0:18:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,手臂放在里面 手放进去 头躺下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your arms in, hands in, head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.55,0:19:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,往下 放轻松 脑袋放空就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down. Just relax and let your mind go blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.01,0:19:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对你来说应该不难\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shouldn't be hard for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss the darkest part of my lily white…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.89,0:19:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动连接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initiate link.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动程序 三号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run sequence unit three. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launching.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.57,0:19:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到第一份数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the first congruency.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好漂亮的大脑 非常活跃 - 真没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a gorgeous brain. Nice activity. - Go figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,同步率 40%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phase-Iock 40%.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我也要进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.22,0:19:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要进入四号舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going in in four.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.85,0:19:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,同步率 99% 连结稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phase-Iock 99%. Link is stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他进去了 杰克 听得到我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in. Jake, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听得到我说话吗？ 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me, Jake?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.25,0:20:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞳孔反应情况良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pupillary reflex is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听觉反应正常 感觉怎样？ 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pinna response normal. How you feeling, Jake?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 欢迎进入你的新身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to your new body, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.43,0:20:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.89,0:20:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 我们慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're gonna take this nice and easy, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.47,0:20:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用你的拇指碰其他的手指 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And touch your thumb to your fingers. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用拇指碰其他的手指 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thumb to your fingers. - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.14,0:20:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得不错 看来你还记得怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good. I can see you can remember that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.81,0:20:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道了 - 如果你想坐起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it. - Well, if you want to sit up,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.06,0:20:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就坐起来吧 - 很好 没关系慢慢来 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that's fine. - Okay, good. Just take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.40,0:20:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇静剂没有任何副作用 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}nice and slow, Jake. Good. Okay, well, no truncal ataxia, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.48,0:20:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有觉得头晕或不舒服吗 动动你的脚趾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you feeling lightheaded or dizzy at all? You're wiggling your toes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 杰克 - 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. Good, Jake. - That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.36,0:20:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,运动神经控制正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Distal motor control is good. Good, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.49,0:20:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有感到哪里发麻或者疼痛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you feeling any numbness or pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.50,0:20:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 杰克 - 等一下 现在 别着急\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great, Jake. Hold on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.87,0:20:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢一点 不要操之过急 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. Don't get ahead of yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.21,0:20:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还要测试一些感官反射动作\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a few more sensory motor reflex tests we need to run,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:21:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以要慢慢来 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- so take it easy. - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 - 坐下 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jake. - Sit down, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.55,0:21:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克！ 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake! Listen to me. Jake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.59,0:21:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克！ 你得坐下 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need you to sit down. Jake! - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.34,0:21:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听我说 - 没事 我控制得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Buddy, listen to me. - It's all good. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.22,0:21:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 你必须立刻坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, you need to sit down right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.36,0:21:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快把他弄回床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, get him back on the gurney now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.93,0:21:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 为了你的安全起见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. For your own safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.51,0:21:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须坐下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need to sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.14,0:21:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要时间适应你的阿凡达身体 喔！ 杰克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need time to adjust to the avatar… Whoa! Jake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 小心尾巴 - 耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God, Jake, watch your tail. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.40,0:21:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他注射镇定剂！ 一千毫克镇定剂！ 快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sedate! Sedate him! A thousand milligrams of Supitocam! Stat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.57,0:21:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位！ 各位！ 小心！ 小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys! Guys! Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.95,0:21:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,参照说明\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.03,0:21:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 别这样 - 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jake. Come on. - Jake! Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.53,0:21:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不习惯你的阿凡达\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not used to your avatar body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这很危险 - 这感觉太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is dangerous. - This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.95,0:21:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake? Jake, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了 他们会把你麻醉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. They're gonna put you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.79,0:21:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺姆 你得坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norm, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.90,0:21:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 我得弄掉这些线\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I gotta get out of these leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.55,0:21:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 快把他俩弄回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it! Bring them home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 诺姆 不要擅自离开 - 你还没准备好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Norm! Do not leave control! - You're not ready for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 看你有什么本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, you ain't got no skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,差一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.56,0:21:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不需要防守你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even have to play defense on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你们好 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.81,0:21:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我去把他抓回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, I'll get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.19,0:21:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 你必须回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, you have to come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake! Jake! Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.52,0:22:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心 - 对不起！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch it! - Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.23,0:22:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.78,0:22:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 你不能随便奔跑的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake! We're not supposed to be running!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.17,0:22:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啦 对不起 - 小心点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jeez! Sorry. - Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.86,0:22:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 陆战队的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Marine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.19,0:22:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.89,0:22:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你还以为是谁？ 笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who'd you expect, numbnuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.03,0:22:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别发呆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.37,0:22:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作控制看来很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motor control's looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.46,0:23:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家安静下来 好了 熄灯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, everybody, quiet down! All right, gang, lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.47,0:23:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,露易丝 快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Louise, chop-chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.05,0:23:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.06,0:23:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别玩那玩意 会弄瞎你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't play with that, you'll go blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.35,0:23:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's kind of freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.89,0:23:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Scat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.31,0:23:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.44,0:23:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,关灯啦 孩子们 晚餐时候见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights out! See you at dinner, kiddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.59,0:23:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.60,0:24:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧 没事吧 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? You all right? - Yeah, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.65,0:24:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫楚迪 专门负责接送科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Trudy. I fly all the science sorties.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.40,0:24:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this here is my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.53,0:24:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.70,0:24:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 温弗利 快点装好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Wainfleet! Get it done!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.03,0:24:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们九点就要出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We bounce at zero-nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.19,0:24:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经在弄了 上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm on it, capitaine!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.87,0:24:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射器还是有点松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vine strike's still loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.92,0:24:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们装了不少重武器啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are packing some heavy gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.17,0:24:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.17,0:24:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为我们并非唯一会在天上飞的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's 'cause we're not the only thing flying around out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.92,0:24:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是最具威胁性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the biggest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.68,0:24:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在缺个人手 你就先担任侧翼机枪手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need you on a door gun. I'm a man short.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.60,0:24:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你不会要求呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd never ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.76,0:24:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你要见的人 咱们飞机上见\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's your man. See you on the flight line.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.65,0:24:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找我吗？ 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to see me, Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.11,0:24:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的低重力会让你变得怠惰\N{\fnArial\fs30}This low gravity'll make you soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.16,0:25:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是变得怠惰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get soft,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.96,0:25:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘多拉的生物会不费吹灰之力地把你干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pandora will shit you out dead with zero warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.34,0:25:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过你的档案了 下士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled your record, Corporal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.96,0:25:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,委内瑞拉丛林 那还真是个凶险的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Venezuela, that was some mean bush.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.34,0:25:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但跟这里比 简直天差地远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing like this here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.93,0:25:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很有种 小子 敢跑到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got some heart, kid, showing up in this neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.35,0:25:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想不过就是另一个地狱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured it's just another hellhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.35,0:25:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己曾经也是个侦查兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was First Recon myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.86,0:25:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你早个几年 搞不好更早\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few years ahead of you. Well, maybe more than a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.03,0:25:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,去了尼日利亚三次 毫发无伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three tours Nigeria, not a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.03,0:25:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但来这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.28,0:25:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一天就中奖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.50,0:25:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是觉得我像个刚剃了头的菜鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I felt like a shavetail louie?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.62,0:25:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等当时我要是回地球去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. They could fix me up,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.12,0:25:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就可以帮我动手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I rotated back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.87,0:25:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我恢复帅气的样貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and make me pretty again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.80,0:25:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你知道吗？ 我更喜欢现在这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what? I kind of like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.05,0:25:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可以随时提醒我 外面有些什么凶险玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It reminds me every day what's waiting out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.88,0:26:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿凡达计划是个无聊的笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Avatar Program is a bad joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.34,0:26:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,养了一群没用的科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunch of limp-dick science majors.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.89,0:26:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 这无非是另一种机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, it does present an opportunity both timely and unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.90,0:26:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 后方清空！ - 清空！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clear! - Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.74,0:26:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个伪装成阿凡达的侦查兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}A recon gyrene in an avatar body.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.05,0:26:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个绝妙的组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a potent mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.95,0:26:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,令我兴奋地连鸡皮疙瘩都起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the goose bumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.70,0:26:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的一个陆战队员的确能给我提供不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a Marine could provide the intel I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.21,0:26:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,实地的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}right on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.21,0:26:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,最深入的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right in the hostiles' camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.92,0:26:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 萨利 我要你从内部了解这帮土著\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Sully. I want you to learn these savages from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.34,0:26:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你赢得他们的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to gain their trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.09,0:26:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须知道怎样才能让他们就范\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know how to force their cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.93,0:26:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是如何逼他们就范 如果他们不肯屈服\N{\fnArial\fs30}or hammer them hard if they won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.93,0:26:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我还是奥古斯汀小组的成员吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I still with Augustine?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.84,0:26:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,台面上是\N{\fnArial\fs30}On paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.27,0:26:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以和那些科学家一起做研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you walk like one of her science pukes,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.74,0:26:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也可以跟他们闲话家常\N{\fnArial\fs30}you quack like one,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.94,0:26:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是向我报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you report to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.94,0:26:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做得到吗 小子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that for me, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.28,0:27:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.57,0:27:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.38,0:27:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 我会照顾自己人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, I take care of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.34,0:27:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿到我需要的东西后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get me what I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.55,0:27:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你回来时我会让你重新站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see to it you get your legs back when you rotate home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.68,0:27:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你自己的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your real legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.85,0:27:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很诱人 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds real good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.61,0:27:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 连结准备就绪！ - 同步率40%\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Link's ready! - Phase-Iock 40%.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.94,0:27:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不许出声 让诺姆负责说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep your mouth shut and let Norm do the talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.11,0:27:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,第五阶段融合完成 同步率90%\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have five congruencies. Phase-Iock 90%.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.74,0:27:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,三号舱准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Link three ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.75,0:27:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我要进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.32,0:28:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔姆兽就在你右面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sturmbeest herd coming up on your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.12,0:28:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了！ 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it! Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.45,0:28:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙就像是公牛 但又带有些温柔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a bull, a dozen cows and some juveniles.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.13,0:29:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉引擎 我们会在这里停留一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut it down. We're gonna stay a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.97,0:29:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 诺姆 你的背包 - 背包\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Norm! Your pack. - Pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.39,0:29:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就待在飞机旁吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.11,0:29:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个拿着枪的白痴就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One idiot with a gun is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.81,0:29:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说了算 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You the man, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.06,0:30:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘多拉狐猴 没有攻击性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prolemuris. They're not aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.07,0:30:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松点 陆战队的 你搞得我也紧张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Marine. You're making me nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.78,0:30:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们如何知道我们来到这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how will they know we're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.45,0:30:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很确定他们现在正在监视着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure they're watching us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.25,0:30:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里曾经是我们建的学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.29,0:30:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这里只是一个贮藏库了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's just… storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.42,0:30:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些孩子都是非常聪明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids were so bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.05,0:30:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,热衷于学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eager to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.43,0:30:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的人类语言甚至不用我教也学得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}They picked up English faster than I could teach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.31,0:30:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么拿一些酸碱检测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we'll take a couple of these Ph monitors…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.56,0:30:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,和探泥针\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and a soil probe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.14,0:31:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边的小黄色箱子 有个旧的显微镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little yellow case back there. The old microscope.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.07,0:31:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.24,0:31:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对 我很爱这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. I love this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.36,0:31:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些刺蝠把它们都搞到地上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stingbats knocked them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.12,0:31:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都希望能有孩子回到这里 再读读它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep hoping someone will come back in and read them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.42,0:31:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么不回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't they come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.05,0:31:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥玛蒂卡亚族部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Omaticaya…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.13,0:31:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经精通了我们的语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}learned as much about us as they needed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.31,0:31:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.52,0:31:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还打算用这装备来帮我们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to help us with this gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.44,0:31:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有很多事要忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a lot to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.12,0:32:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别停下 诺姆 - 你们俩跟紧了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep moving, Norm. - Keep up, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.50,0:32:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么就开始啦 - 扫描中\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And here I go. - Scanning.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.51,0:32:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这么快？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! It's that fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.93,0:32:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很惊人 是吧？ - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amazing, isn't it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.10,0:32:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是信号传导\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that is signal transduction from this root.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.98,0:32:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这个树根传到旁边的那个树根\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the root of the tree next to it. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.15,0:32:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该采集一个样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should take a sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.69,0:32:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.40,0:32:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,反应速度那么快 我觉得这里可能有电流\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's probably electrical, based on the speed of the reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.36,0:32:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺姆 你的口水污染到样本了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norm, you've contaminated the sample with your saliva.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.79,0:32:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.36,0:33:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,再采一个样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.72,0:33:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪 别开枪 你会把它惹毛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot. Don't shoot, you'll piss him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.31,0:33:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经把它惹毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's already pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.10,0:33:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 它皮太厚 子弹打不穿 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, that armor's too thick. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.86,0:33:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只是在宣示它的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a territorial threat display.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.75,0:33:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别跑 否则他会冲上来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not run, or he'll charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.57,0:34:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我要做啥 跟它跳舞吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do I do, dance with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.83,0:34:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在原地别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold your ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.01,0:34:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 看你有什么能耐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Come on! What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.51,0:34:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 看谁厉害 这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Who's bad? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.48,0:34:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就对了 畜牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what I'm talking about, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.44,0:34:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啦 滚回去找你的妈咪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, get your punk ass back to mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.11,0:34:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这些能耐啊 快滚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Yeah, you got nothing. You keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.11,0:34:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不再多叫几个同伴过来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and why don't you bring back some of your friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.20,0:34:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.13,0:34:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么应付这种 跑 还是不跑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what about this one? Run? Don't run? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.05,0:35:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 当然要跑啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Definitely run!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.57,0:38:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天只能到此为止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to call it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.95,0:38:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校有命令不许夜间飞行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not allowed to run night ops. Colonel's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.58,0:38:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 博士 他只能靠自己撑到早上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Doc, he's just gonna have to hang on till morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.91,0:38:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他撑不到明天早上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't make it till morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.44,0:40:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没那时间陪你们耗整晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have all goddamn night.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.24,0:40:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊！ 来啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.27,0:42:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 别扔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait. Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.40,0:42:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.00,0:43:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你可能听不懂我在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know you probably don't understand this,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.64,0:43:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.02,0:43:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.44,0:43:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真让人印象深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.65,0:43:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是没有你 我早就没命了 这真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have been screwed if you hadn't come along. It was…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.16,0:43:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你要去那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait a second. Hey, where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.29,0:43:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.50,0:43:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,走慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… Hey, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.33,0:43:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想谢谢你 帮我杀了那些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, wait up, I just wanted to say thanks for killing those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.50,0:44:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 不要道谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn! - Don't thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.47,0:44:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮不需要道谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't thank for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.39,0:44:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这实在太可悲了 非常可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is sad. Very sad only.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.27,0:44:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.19,0:44:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我做了什么 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever I did, I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.53,0:44:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是你的错 它们本来不应该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this is your fault. They did not need to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.53,0:44:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的错 它们攻击我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fault? They attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.78,0:44:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么我倒成了坏人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I the bad guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.70,0:44:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你的错！- 哎 喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.83,0:44:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是你的错！- 别激动 别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your fault! - Easy. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.62,0:44:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就像个婴儿 只会乱叫 不知所措\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like a baby. Making noise, don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.37,0:44:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.13,0:44:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.71,0:44:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你这么爱你的森林朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you love your little forest friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.38,0:44:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不干脆让它们杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}why not let them just kill my ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.22,0:44:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么逻辑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.81,0:44:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要救你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why save you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.22,0:44:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 为什么要救我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, why save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.94,0:44:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一颗坚强的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a strong heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.03,0:45:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,无畏无惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.74,0:45:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是很愚昧 像个孩子一样无知\N{\fnArial\fs30}But stupid! Ignorant like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.04,0:45:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我像个孩子 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if I'm like a child, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.13,0:45:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那或许你该教教我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, maybe you should teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.42,0:45:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们天空人永远都学不会 你们不用心去感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sky People cannot learn. You do not See.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.72,0:45:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那教教我怎么感受啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then teach me how to See.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.63,0:45:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有人能够教你如何用心去感受 - 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No one can teach you to See. - Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.47,0:45:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 别这样 我们不能多聊聊吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, come on, can't we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.89,0:45:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说 你在哪里学的人类语言？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say, where'd you learn to speak English?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.37,0:45:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥古斯汀博士的学校？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Augustine's school?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.61,0:45:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是像个婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.44,0:45:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是像个婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.49,0:45:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.16,0:45:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就不应该来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should not be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.00,0:45:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 让我跟你一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.72,0:45:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.50,0:46:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.05,0:46:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.90,0:46:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.72,0:46:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}What…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.68,0:46:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.52,0:46:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂之树的种子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeds of the Sacred Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.56,0:47:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常纯洁的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very pure spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.34,0:47:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.38,0:47:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.93,0:47:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.22,0:47:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.07,0:47:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.29,0:48:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.13,0:48:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.70,0:48:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.53,0:48:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 大家冷静一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm people, calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.17,0:48:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏泰 你这是在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, Tsu'tey?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.46,0:48:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些恶魔禁止到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}These demons are forbidden here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.18,0:48:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现神迹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has been a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.51,0:48:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须交由查希克决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a matter for the Tsahik.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.68,0:49:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.19,0:49:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.11,0:49:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.20,0:49:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.70,0:49:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.89,0:50:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.06,0:50:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感受到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.58,0:50:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地球人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This creature…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.29,0:50:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么把他带到这里来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…why do you bring him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.83,0:50:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原本要杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to kill him…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.50,0:50:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我看见艾娃显现神迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but there was a sign from Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.50,0:50:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have said…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.59,0:50:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许带梦行者到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no dreamwalker will come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.34,0:50:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.68,0:51:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个外星人的臭味真令我作呕\N{\fnArial\fs30}His alien smell fills my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.60,0:51:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.68,0:51:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲在决定是否要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father is deciding whether to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.56,0:51:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父亲 很高兴见到您 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father. It's nice to meet you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.19,0:51:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开这个生物 谁都别动他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.82,0:51:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来看看这个外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will look at this alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.36,0:51:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.66,0:51:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是查希克 能够解读艾娃神谕的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is Tsahik. The one who interprets the will of Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.50,0:51:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是艾娃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Eywa?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.71,0:51:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you called?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.38,0:51:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.68,0:51:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么来到这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you come to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.41,0:51:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来学习的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.85,0:51:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾经试过教导其他天空人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have tried to teach other Sky People.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.90,0:51:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是自满的人是很难去接受别人的教导\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is hard to fill a cup which is already full.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.74,0:52:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点都不自满 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my cup is empty, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.28,0:52:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以去问奥古斯汀博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just ask Dr. Augustine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.86,0:52:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不是一位科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.04,0:52:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你又是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.75,0:52:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾是个陆战队员 就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a Marine. A…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.83,0:52:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名「锅盖头族」的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A warrior of the Jarhead clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.92,0:52:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个战士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.26,0:52:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能轻易就宰了他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could kill him easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.84,0:52:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能轻易就宰了他！ 不行！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could kill him easily! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.55,0:52:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们第一次遇到梦行者战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the first warrior dreamwalker…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.76,0:52:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前从未遇见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we have seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.72,0:52:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要多加了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to learn more about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.02,0:52:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Daughter…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.98,0:52:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将负责教导他学习我们文化\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you will teach him our way…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.36,0:52:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,学习我们的语言和我们的生活方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to speak and walk as we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.82,0:52:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是我教 这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why me? That's not fair…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.24,0:52:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.82,0:52:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿会教你我们的生活方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter will teach you our ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.46,0:52:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好学吧 杰克·萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learn well, Jakesully.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.84,0:53:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们再看看 你是否还有药可治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we will see if your insanity can be cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.36,0:53:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.86,0:53:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用麻烦站起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.49,0:53:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.16,0:53:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.42,0:53:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.72,0:53:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.26,0:53:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说啊 我还不知道你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I don't even know your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.31,0:53:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮特丽 特 卡哈 莫阿特伊特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neytiri te Ckaha Mo'at'ite.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.02,0:53:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来 可以慢一点吗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again, a whole lot slower?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.98,0:54:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮特丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neytiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.36,0:54:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮特里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neytili.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.48,0:54:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮特丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neytiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.74,0:54:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮特丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neytiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.66,0:54:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你 妮特丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to meet you, Neytiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.28,0:54:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.37,0:54:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 - 他处于α脑波态 - 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jake. - He's in alpha. - Jake!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.75,0:54:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他快醒过来了 - 杰克 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's coming out right now. - Jake. Jake!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.58,0:55:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 孩子 醒醒 这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on back, kid. Come on. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.34,0:55:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. There you go, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.09,0:55:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事了 你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.55,0:55:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 你投入得就像只吸血扁虱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn! You were dug in like a tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.56,0:55:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的阿凡达安全吗 - 他很安全 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is the avatar safe? - Yeah, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.23,0:55:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们绝对不会相信我去了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are not gonna believe where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.94,0:55:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最后看到的是这个海军陆战队员的背影\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last thing we see is this Marine's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.03,0:55:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失在森林中\N{\fnArial\fs30}disappearing into the brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.25,0:55:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那头怒气冲冲的闪雷兽紧追着他的屁股跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}with this angry thanator coming after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.16,0:55:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这可不是一般人学得来的 - 真了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, it's not something you can teach. - That is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.24,0:55:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么原因我也无法理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for reasons I cannot fathom,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.62,0:55:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么奥玛蒂卡亚族选择了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Omaticaya have chosen you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.49,0:55:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷帮了我们一个大忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}God help us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.29,0:55:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,锅盖头族！\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Jarhead clan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.38,0:55:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们居然信了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it worked?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.77,0:55:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在跟他们是一家人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm practically family.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.51,0:55:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna study me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.73,0:55:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我要学习如何成为他们的一份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to learn to be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.01,0:55:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就叫先发制人 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's called taking the initiative, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.68,0:55:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望能多十个像你这么能干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I had 10 more like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.21,0:55:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 萨利 萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Sully. Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.31,0:56:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着查出那些蓝猴子到底想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just find out what the blue monkeys want.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.48,0:56:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.15,0:56:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给他们医疗 教育 道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we try to give them medicine, education, roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.32,0:56:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没用 他们只爱玩泥巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no, no, no, they like mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.24,0:56:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那倒是无所谓 不过问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that wouldn't bother me, it's just that they're…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.78,0:56:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你能 谁来弄一下 第十二区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can you… Can somebody just… Sector 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.62,0:56:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 走 走 走 停 停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, go, go, go, stop. Stop…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.83,0:56:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 停下！ 那是 天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rich, stop! That's… Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.04,0:56:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们那该死的部落刚好就位于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their damn village happens to be resting on the richest unobtanium deposit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.22,0:56:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,方圆两百公里之内 最丰富的矿区上\N{\fnArial\fs30}within 200 klicks in any direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.35,0:56:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看那些矿藏！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at all that cheddar!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.35,0:56:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁能说服他们离开呢？ - 你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, who gets them to move? - Guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.77,0:56:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他们不想离开呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they won't go?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.54,0:56:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢打赌他们一定会离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm betting that they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.82,0:56:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 嘿 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, okay, okay, hey. Look. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.36,0:56:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了那些土著的确会很令人难堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing the indigenous looks bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.28,0:56:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是比起那些媒体的丑闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's one thing that shareholders hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.23,0:56:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,股东们更在意的只有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}more than bad press,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.12,0:56:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是难看的季度报表\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's a bad quarterly statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.98,0:57:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些规矩不是我定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't make up the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.37,0:57:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以帮我找一个能够让他们搬离这里的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So just find me a carrot that'll get them to move,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.33,0:57:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.22,0:57:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能只能用我们的手段了 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's gonna have to be all stick. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.00,0:57:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有三个月的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.77,0:57:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,届时推土机将会到达那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when the 'dozers get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.80,0:57:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这不是在浪费时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.76,0:57:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.05,0:57:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在 - 好 我们再来一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys, right now… - Okay, let's run through them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.56,0:57:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫娅 龙族之女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mo'at. Dragon lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.94,0:57:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃图坎 - 埃图康 他是部落的酋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eytucan. - Eytukan. He's the clan leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.98,0:57:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但莫娅是精神领袖 就像萨满\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's the spiritual leader. Like a shaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.23,0:57:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.90,0:57:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 苏泰 - 苏泰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- T'su'tey. - Tsu'tey.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.20,0:57:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 苏泰 - 他将是下一任的酋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tsu'tey. - He'll be the next clan leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.95,0:57:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妮特丽 - 她将是下一任的查希克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Neytiri. - She'll be the next Tsahik.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.50,0:57:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将会配对\N{\fnArial\fs30}They become a mated pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.50,0:57:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那艾娃是谁？ - 艾娃是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So who's this Eywa? - Who's Eywa?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.67,0:57:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们唯一的神 创造出许多生命的造物者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only their deity. Their goddess, made up of all living things.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.34,0:57:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所不知的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything they know!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.76,0:57:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是接受过训练就不会问这种问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd know this if you had any training whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.97,0:57:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁正在和酋长的女儿约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's got a date with the chief's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.39,0:57:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.64,0:58:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个别闹了 把这里搞得托儿所似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock it off. It's like kindergarten around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.85,0:58:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮特丽曾经是我最好的学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neytiri was my best student.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.89,0:58:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和她姐姐 Sylwanin\N{\fnArial\fs30}She and her sister, Sylwanin.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.98,0:58:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是很棒的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just amazing girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.48,0:58:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也跟Sylwanin有个约会哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a date with Sylwanin too.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.99,0:58:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.91,0:58:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 乡村生活可是很早就开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Village life starts early.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.66,0:58:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别做什么太愚蠢的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do anything unusually stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.35,0:58:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖 小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.31,0:58:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘多拉烈马是母的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pale is female.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.36,0:58:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 乖 小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Easy, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.56,0:59:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是「萨黑鲁」 心灵连接\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is shahaylu. The bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.48,0:59:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.86,0:59:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受她的心跳 她的呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel her heartbeat. Her breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.99,0:59:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受它健壮的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel her strong legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.24,0:59:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以告诉它要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may tell her what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.66,0:59:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,用心告诉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.83,0:59:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 告诉它要去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now, say where to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.75,0:59:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,往前！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forward!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.61,1:00:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该离开这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.17,1:00:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 你会想我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you'd miss me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.15,1:00:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会说人类语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you could speak English.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.03,1:00:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个外星人根本学不会任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This alien will learn nothing…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.62,1:00:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,连颗石头都比他知道的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a rock sees more…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.62,1:00:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧他那副德性\N{\fnArial\fs30}…look at him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.76,1:00:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,再试一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.92,1:00:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真想要攻击这里的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to hit this thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.26,1:00:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将会非常麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's gonna be complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.43,1:00:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的扫瞄器无法显示它内部的结构\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your scan doesn't show the internal structure.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.01,1:00:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,外围是一圈柱状物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an outer row of columns.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.14,1:00:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常结实 这里还有第二圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real heavy duty. There's a secondary ring here,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.98,1:00:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面还有一圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}and an inner ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.36,1:00:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,核心部分则是像螺旋形的结构\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a core structure like a spiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.48,1:00:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是为何他们能在树内上下移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how they move up and down.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.19,1:01:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要准确扫瞄每根支柱的构造\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need accurate scans on every column.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.11,1:01:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.57,1:01:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于结构你还有什么要提供吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else can you tell us about the structure?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.28,1:01:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这第二圈支柱也是支撑结构\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing this secondary ring, that's also load-bearing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.66,1:01:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要去那里 - 离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So where are we going? - Getting out of Dodge.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.50,1:01:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会让帕克和夸奇插手这里的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not about to let Selfridge and Quaritch micro-manage this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.76,1:01:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十六号哨站有一个移动的连结室\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a mobile link up at Site 26 we can work out of,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.09,1:01:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以在山里继续研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}way up in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.80,1:01:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利路亚山？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hallelujah Mountains?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.18,1:01:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 你说的是真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right. - Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.56,1:01:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.98,1:01:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说中的潘多拉悬浮山 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legendary floating mountains of Pandora.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.37,1:01:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,又没听说过了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard of them?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.17,1:01:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.13,1:02:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 看看我的仪器吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, look at my instruments.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.84,1:02:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进入电磁旋涡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. We're in the Flux Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.88,1:02:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在开始目视飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're VFR from here on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.22,1:02:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是目视飞行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's VFR?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.18,1:02:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是用你的眼睛来看路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means you gotta see where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.64,1:02:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我什么都看不见啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.78,1:02:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 很夸张吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. Ain't that a bitch?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.04,1:02:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.72,1:02:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧你们那副表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should see your faces.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.12,1:03:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢您搭乘潘多拉航空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for flying Air Pandora.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.55,1:03:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么维持着他们漂浮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what does hold them up?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.35,1:03:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝向我解释过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace explained it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.56,1:03:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是由于某种磁悬浮的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of maglev effect.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.56,1:03:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为unobtanium是一种类似超导的物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because unobtanium is a superconductor… or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.96,1:04:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to camp.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.38,1:04:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以 我睡这里 - 好恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, this is my bunk. - This stuff is nasty.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.35,1:04:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 诺姆 你睡下面 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Norm, go under. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.47,1:04:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝什么都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace didn't miss a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.41,1:04:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚迪 你睡上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trudy, you'll take the top one.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.02,1:04:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道我跟上校暗中往来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knew I was talking to the Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.52,1:04:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她目前还需要我才能让她重回到部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I had what she needed, a way back in with the clan,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.23,1:04:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她现在对我还算客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she's playing nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.94,1:04:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 杰克 左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Jake, hang a left.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.49,1:04:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你使用最后面一台连接舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be in the link at the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.91,1:04:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号舱 比尤拉 她是这里最稳定的一台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unit one. Beulah. She's the least glitchy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.21,1:05:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.42,1:05:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要盯着她的眼睛看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not look in her eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.89,1:05:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊卡兰不是马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ikran is not horse.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.77,1:05:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦完成了「萨黑鲁」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once shahaylu is made,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.48,1:05:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊卡兰终身只会跟随一名猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}ikran will fly with only one hunter in the whole life.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.75,1:06:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想成为「塔龙纽」 也就是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To become taronyu, hunter,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.58,1:06:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须选择你自己的伊卡兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must choose your own ikran.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.87,1:06:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时它也要选择你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he must choose you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.72,1:06:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么时候 - 等你准备好的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When? - When you are ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.14,1:07:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 影像日记第十二号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. This is video log 12.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.48,1:07:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间是晚上九点三十二分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's 21:32.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.61,1:07:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非得要现在做这些吗 我真的很想睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have to do this now? I really need to get some rack.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.03,1:07:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 就现在 趁热打铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, now. When it's fresh.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.53,1:07:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 地点 棚屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, location, shack,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.37,1:07:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,日子开始搞混在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the days are starting to blur together.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.83,1:07:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威语很难学 但是 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The language is a pain, but, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.09,1:07:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得就像拆装武器一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure it's like field-stripping a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.58,1:07:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要反覆地练习 反覆地练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just repetition, repetition.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.38,1:07:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 眼睛 - 眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Navi. - "Nari."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.05,1:07:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 眼睛 - 眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nari. - "Narrri"!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.39,1:07:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Narrri!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.60,1:07:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力一点 用力一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Txurnì'ul. Stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.23,1:07:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮特丽称呼我为「斯康」 意思是笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neytiri calls me skxawng. It means moron.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.23,1:07:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是很重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a very important part of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.74,1:07:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在诺姆对我的态度也大有好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norm's attitude has improved lately.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.30,1:07:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感受到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you. I see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.95,1:08:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威语的看见不仅仅是用眼睛看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not just, "I'm seeing you in front of me, "
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.41,1:08:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是用心灵感应到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's "I see into you. I See you."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.16,1:08:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,能和他友好相处是很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good he's back on board,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.67,1:08:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他也认为我是个笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he thinks I'm a skxawng, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.91,1:08:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我接受你 我理解你」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm accepting you. I understand you."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.41,1:08:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得搞清楚差别？好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you gotta get this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.50,1:08:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得快点 好了吗？ 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta run! Okay? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.25,1:08:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脚变得越来越强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}My feet are getting tougher.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.30,1:08:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一天跑得比一天远\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can run farther every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.71,1:08:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须相信我的身体才能去做任何困难的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to trust my body to know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.93,1:08:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 看到没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.48,1:08:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.02,1:08:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每天都在观察森林小径\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day it's reading the trails,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.30,1:08:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,像水坑中的足迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}the tracks at the waterhole,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.94,1:08:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,察觉最微小的气味和声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}the tiniest scents and sounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.74,1:08:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她总是提到一种会流动的能量 万物的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's always going on about the flow of energy, the spirits of animals.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.29,1:08:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望最终测验的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really hope this tree-hugger crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.84,1:08:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有这些锁碎的题目\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't on the final.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.09,1:08:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是单靠眼睛看和双手触摸就可以理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't just about eye-hand coordination out there, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.80,1:09:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须仔细倾听她所说的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to listen to what she says.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.59,1:09:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,透过她的眼睛 去感受这片森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to see the forest through her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.80,1:09:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 这可是我的影像日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. This is my video log here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.82,1:09:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着妮特丽学习 如果不学快一点就完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Neytiri, it's learn fast or die.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.66,1:09:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在开玩笑的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.86,1:10:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说服莫娅让格蕾丝来到部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talked Mo'at into letting Grace into the village.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.03,1:10:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你们 都长这么高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look how big you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.74,1:10:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从她的学校关闭后 这是她第一次回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the first time since her school was closed down.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.74,1:10:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你变得好漂亮啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.73,1:10:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,去睡觉 陆战队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Marine.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.54,1:11:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着用心体会这种微妙的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to understand this deep connection.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.34,1:11:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,人和森林的心灵感应\N{\fnArial\fs30}the people have to the forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.01,1:11:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说能量就如同某种连结网路\N{\fnArial\fs30}She talks about a network of energy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.68,1:11:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,万物都是息息相关的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that flows through all living things.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.14,1:11:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说 生命都是由万物所生成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says all energy is only borrowed,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.35,1:11:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 生命将回到最原始的起点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one day you have to give it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.06,1:12:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天进入了阿凡达16个小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in 16 hours today.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.40,1:12:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的体重不断在减少\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still losing weight.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.91,1:12:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.62,1:12:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要去睡一会儿 - 给我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I gotta get some sleep. - Come back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.58,1:12:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝好胃口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bon appétit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.42,1:12:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我杀生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today I made a kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.88,1:12:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还吃了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we ate it. At least,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.06,1:12:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于知道他们的食物来源了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where that meal came from.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.09,1:12:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是另一个身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other body.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.70,1:12:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你也要照顾这一个身体的 知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to take care of this body. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.35,1:12:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道了吗？ 我们吃了它 - 好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get it? Let's eat it. - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.64,1:12:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我来帮你把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. I'll make it easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.10,1:12:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把袋子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.44,1:12:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真邋遢 - 谢谢夸奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look like crap. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.02,1:12:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做事太极端了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're burning way too hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.86,1:12:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这狗屎弄走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get rid of this shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.78,1:12:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你可以继续诉说我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you can lecture me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.78,1:12:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我要跟你讲 作为你的老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm telling you, as your boss,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.95,1:12:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者以后还有可能变为朋友的人 我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and as someone who might even consider being a friend someday.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.37,1:13:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你坐下来待会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take some down time.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.87,1:13:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你吃了它吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat this, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.13,1:13:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我吧 我了解你的艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I… learned the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.98,1:13:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那间学校发生过什么事 格蕾丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did happen at the school, Grace?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.74,1:13:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮特丽的姐姐 Sylwanin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neytiri's sister, Sylwanin,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.62,1:13:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然间再也没来上学\N{\fnArial\fs30}stopped coming to school.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.45,1:13:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对于森林的砍伐非常气愤\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was angry about the clear-cutting.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.50,1:13:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one day,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.73,1:13:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和另一对年轻的猎人跑了进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}she and a couple of other young hunters came running in.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.96,1:13:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,全身都绘上了东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}all painted up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.17,1:13:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们烧了一台推土机\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had set a bulldozer on fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.13,1:13:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些士兵跟踪他们一直到学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess they thought I could protect them.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.81,1:14:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们以为我可以保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The troopers pursued them to the school.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.81,1:14:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在门口把Sylwanin打死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed Sylwanin in the doorway.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.06,1:14:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在妮特丽面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right in front of Neytiri.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.48,1:14:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后开始向其他孩子开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then shot the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.44,1:14:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然大部分孩子都被我带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got most of the kids out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.99,1:14:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们再也没有来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they never came back.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.46,1:14:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.05,1:14:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个科学家不能有任何偏见\N{\fnArial\fs30}A scientist stays objective.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.68,1:14:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能被情绪而驱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't be ruled by emotion.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.60,1:14:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我花了10年心血在那间学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I put 10 years of my life into that school.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.81,1:14:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫我sa'nok\N{\fnArial\fs30}They called me sa'nok.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.65,1:14:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.73,1:14:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.15,1:15:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那伤痛跟随着我到了现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kind of pain reaches back through the link.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.02,1:15:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感受到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.23,1:15:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.90,1:15:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.23,1:15:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的灵魂将与艾娃同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your spirit goes with Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.65,1:15:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的身体将留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your body stays behind…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.78,1:15:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为我们的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to become part of The People.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.12,1:15:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一箭毙命\N{\fnArial\fs30}A clean kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.96,1:15:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.11,1:16:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,学习驾驭伊卡兰 我们称之为「女妖翼兽」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learning to ride an ikran, we call them banshees,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.57,1:16:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是每一位猎人都必经的考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the test every young hunter has to pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.37,1:16:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要完成这项考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to do that,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.70,1:16:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要先抵达女妖翼兽的栖息地\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gotta go where the banshees are.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.54,1:16:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oo-rah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.24,1:17:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.60,1:18:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·萨利先来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakesully will go first.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.43,1:19:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你要选择你的伊卡兰 你要用内心去感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you choose your ikran. This you must feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.35,1:19:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它也选择你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he also chooses you,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.60,1:19:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的动作要快 像我示范的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}move quick like I showed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.39,1:19:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有一次机会 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will have one chance, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.27,1:19:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么知道它选上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will I know if he chooses me?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.52,1:19:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会试图杀掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will try to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.65,1:19:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.34,1:20:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来跳舞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.89,1:20:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个笨蛋快没命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That moron's going to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.62,1:21:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要害怕 战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid, warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.58,1:21:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点缔结关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the bond!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.38,1:21:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.38,1:21:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.52,1:21:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨黑鲁 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shahaylu, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.53,1:21:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨黑鲁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shahaylu!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.87,1:22:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.63,1:22:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 没错 你是我的了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right. You're mine. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.94,1:22:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次飞行认定关系 你不能等\N{\fnArial\fs30}First flight seals the bond. You cannot wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.40,1:22:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想着飞 - 飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Think, "Fly!" - Fly?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.21,1:22:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.88,1:22:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 完了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.60,1:23:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 直飞！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up and fly straight!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.03,1:23:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还差不多 向左转！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Bank left!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.66,1:23:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持水平 这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Level out! That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.96,1:23:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 杰克·萨利！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake Sully!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.07,1:24:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.16,1:24:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.92,1:24:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 宝贝 我成功了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, baby, I got this!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.68,1:24:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.23,1:24:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我骑马的技术可能不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may not be much of a horse guy,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.18,1:24:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但骑这个我可是天生的高手\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was born to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.81,1:24:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.86,1:24:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我像这样飞过来 你像这样 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I came like this. This you. - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.03,1:24:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺着风转弯 可以转的更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turn. I feel the wind. I turn very strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.79,1:24:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 我转得太僵硬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, yeah, see, I banked so hard…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.09,1:25:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂之树\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Tree of Souls.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.52,1:25:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们最神圣的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's their most sacred place.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.48,1:25:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那漩涡磁流 还有这些图像？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the Flux Vortex in these false color images?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.40,1:25:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那东西把我的仪器弄挂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what messes up my instruments.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.57,1:26:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有一些很有趣的生物现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something really interesting going on in there biologically.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.49,1:26:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想冒死去取点样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would die to get samples.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.16,1:26:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,外人可是严格禁止进入的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outsiders are strictly forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.08,1:26:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你小子真幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lucky swine.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.78,1:27:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.95,1:27:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.30,1:27:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾是一个冷血的空中猎人 从空中播撒死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a stone-cold aerial hunter. Death from above.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.35,1:27:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但问题是 你也有可能是别人的猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only problem is, you're not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.31,1:28:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,俯冲！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dive!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.17,1:28:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！ 快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.55,1:28:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.31,1:29:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人管它叫做「狮鹰翼兽」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our guys call it a Great Leonopteryx.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.81,1:29:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是托鲁克 最终阴影\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is Toruk. Last Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.61,1:29:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有道理 她会是你死亡前看到的最后影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right. It's the last one you ever see.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.33,1:29:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的曾曾祖父是托鲁克玛克托\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandfather's grandfather was Toruk Macto.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.79,1:29:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,「魅影骑士」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rider of Last Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.96,1:29:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他骑这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He rode this?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.05,1:29:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,托鲁克选择了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toruk chose him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.01,1:29:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据我们族人的传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has only happened five times.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.14,1:29:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史上只发生过五次\N{\fnArial\fs30}since the time of the First Songs.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.97,1:29:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那还真是悠久 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a long time. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.68,1:29:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,魅影骑士非常伟大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toruk Macto was mighty.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.39,1:30:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾在苦难时期把所有部落凝聚起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brought the clans together in a time of great sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.23,1:30:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个纳威人都听过这个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Na'vi people know the story.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.28,1:30:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一件事好像都颠倒了过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is backwards now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.64,1:30:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,彷彿那里才是真实的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like out there is the true world.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.62,1:30:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这里反倒变成了一场梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in here is the dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.31,1:30:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难相信日子才过了三个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to believe it's only been three months.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.06,1:30:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎记不起以前的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can barely remember my old life.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.07,1:30:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至忘了我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who I am anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.67,1:31:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没在森林里迷失了自我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't gotten lost in the woods, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.68,1:31:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离你上一次的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your last report was.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.14,1:31:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经是两个星期前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}more than two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.81,1:31:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都开始怀疑你是不是放弃了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to doubt your resolve!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.90,1:31:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 是时候终止这项任务了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I see it, it's time to terminate the mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.48,1:31:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我可以完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.44,1:31:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already have.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.99,1:31:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给了我很有用的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me good, usable intel.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.28,1:31:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个叫灵魂之树的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Tree of Souls place.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.95,1:31:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我有这个在手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got them by the balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.78,1:31:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,作战时就可以逼他们就范\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that when this turns into a shit fight,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.41,1:31:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争不可避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}which it will. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.12,1:31:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候归队了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's time to come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.59,1:31:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.96,1:31:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以重新站起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gonna get your legs back.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.84,1:32:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经帮你取得了公司的同意 全都搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I got your corporate approval. It's a done deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.51,1:32:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚就可以搭船回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna have you on a shuttle tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.05,1:32:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个说话算话的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a man of my word.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.77,1:32:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须把它完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta finish this.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.81,1:32:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有最后一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.07,1:32:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个仪式 这是成为纳威人的最后阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ceremony. It's the final stage of becoming a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.53,1:32:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果做到了 我就会成为他们的一份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I do it, I'm one of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.16,1:32:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就会信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they'll trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.58,1:32:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就可以跟他们谈搬迁的事宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can negotiate the terms of their relocation.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.39,1:32:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你最好把它搞定 下士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, you'd better get it done, Corporal.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.33,1:33:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威人说 每个人出生后都会经过两次洗礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Na'vi say that every person is born twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.33,1:33:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二次\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second time is.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.51,1:33:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是当你在族人面前取得一个永久的地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you earn your place among The People forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.26,1:33:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是奥玛蒂卡亚族之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are now a son of the Omaticaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.77,1:33:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我们的一份子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are part of The People.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.32,1:34:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come. Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.96,1:34:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们族人祈祷的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a place for prayers to be heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.30,1:34:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候你的祈祷也会灵验\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sometimes answered.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.02,1:34:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们称这些树为「奥特拉亚莫克力」\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call these trees Utraya Mokri.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.73,1:34:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音之树\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Tree of Voices.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.48,1:35:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,先灵之声\N{\fnArial\fs30}The voices of our ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.67,1:35:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以听见他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear them.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.17,1:35:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 他们还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They live, Jake,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.84,1:35:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,与艾娃同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}within Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.43,1:35:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是奥玛蒂卡亚族人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Omaticaya now.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.02,1:35:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以拥有属于你自己的弓箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may make your bow from the wood of Hometree.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.65,1:35:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后选择一位女子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you may choose a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.86,1:35:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很多好女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have many fine women.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.03,1:35:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼娜唱歌最好听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ninat is the best singer.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.91,1:35:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不想要尼娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't want Ninat.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.13,1:36:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩拉是位好猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyral is a good hunter.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.76,1:36:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 她真是位好猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she is a good hunter.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.93,1:36:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我已经选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already chosen.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.18,1:36:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这位女子也必须选择我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this woman must also choose me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.69,1:36:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她早也已经选择好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She already has.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.75,1:37:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你在一起了 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am with you now, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.25,1:37:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们此生永不分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are mated for life.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.42,1:37:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 你在搞什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing, Jake?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.91,1:38:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma Jake!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.12,1:38:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了阶段整合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget your phase integration.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.50,1:38:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 - 不 不 按下中间钮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jake! - No, no, the middle button.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.92,1:38:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得吃点东西 - 对 就是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You gotta eat something. - Yeah, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.26,1:38:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 醒一醒啊 杰克！ 求你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake! Jake. Wake up! Jake, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.85,1:38:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我强喂瘸子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me force-feed a cripple.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.52,1:38:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝 我不想 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace, I don't want… Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.90,1:38:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.95,1:38:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.13,1:38:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吃饱了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. I'm done. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.22,1:38:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上次洗澡是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when was the last time you took a shower?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.55,1:39:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不需要洗澡 - 天哪 陆战队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't need a shower. - Jesus, Marine.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.77,1:39:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.82,1:39:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克！ 醒醒啊！ 杰克！ 醒醒啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake! Wake up! Jake! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.24,1:39:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.24,1:39:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来！ 停下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.75,1:39:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克！ - 回去 停下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jake! - Go back, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.75,1:39:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.59,1:39:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.34,1:39:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了！ - 有个纳威人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I got a native.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.51,1:39:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对着机器乱吼乱叫 他挡到我的路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}doing the funky chicken here. He's blocking my blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.56,1:39:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续开 他会闪开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, keep going. He'll move.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.77,1:39:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人必须明白 我们是不会停的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people have to learn that we don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.74,1:39:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续 走 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.36,1:39:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来！ 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.65,1:39:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！ 快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.95,1:39:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 看到没有？ 他闪开了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, see? He moved.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.79,1:40:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 老兄！ 别！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, dude. Whoa, dude! Dude, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.67,1:40:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我看不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm blind.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.60,1:40:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克！ - 妮特丽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jake! - Neytiri!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.44,1:40:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.01,1:41:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,定格 就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze it right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.18,1:41:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉近 放大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scale up. Enhance.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.26,1:41:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.31,1:41:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.85,1:41:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我找个飞行员来 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get me a pilot. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.78,1:41:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏泰 将带领我们战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tsu'tey will lead the war party.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.54,1:41:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop please!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.33,1:41:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将会使事情变更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will only make it worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.58,1:41:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有你说话的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not speak here!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.42,1:41:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要打得他们满地找牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will strike them in the heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.01,1:41:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏泰 不要这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tsu'tey! Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.31,1:41:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 - 听着 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You! - Listen. Brother…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.32,1:42:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你跟这女人交配了？ - 喔 坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mated with this woman? - Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.74,1:42:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this true?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.24,1:42:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在艾娃的面前互定终身 已成定局了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are mated before Eywa. It is done.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.83,1:42:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.08,1:42:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要去攻击天空人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not attack the Sky People.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.73,1:42:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那样做会害死很多同胞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many Omaticaya will die if you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.92,1:42:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才不是我的兄弟！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not my brother!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.42,1:42:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也不是你的敌人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am not your enemy!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.84,1:42:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的敌人就在外面 他们的火力很强大！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The enemy is out there, and they are very powerful!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.97,1:42:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进！ 前进！ 前进！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.98,1:42:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我跟他们谈 - 不用谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can talk to them. - No more talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.48,1:42:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏泰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tsu'tey!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.11,1:42:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是奥玛蒂卡亚族人 我是你们的一份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Omaticaya. I am one of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.83,1:42:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有说话的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have the right to speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.71,1:42:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些事情要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something to say…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.92,1:43:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你们每一个人说\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to all of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.42,1:43:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些话在我心里已经憋了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}The words are like stones in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.85,1:43:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我很抱歉 别！别！不要！ 住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I'm sorry. No, no, no! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.85,1:43:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能干扰连线！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't interrupt a link in progress!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.31,1:43:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.27,1:43:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.65,1:43:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.07,1:43:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 你给我趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait! - Stay down, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.57,1:43:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Look…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.91,1:43:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是被派到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was sent here to…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.87,1:43:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.46,1:43:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只不过是个使用假身的魔鬼 他不能活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a demon in a false body.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.81,1:44:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你他妈的疯了吗 - 你太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you out of your goddamn mind? - You crossed the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.65,1:44:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这家伙给我带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wheel this meat out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.53,1:44:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 到底发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake! What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.33,1:44:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我真失望 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me down, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.08,1:44:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么了 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.88,1:44:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里找到了个土著女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}you find yourself some local tail.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.92,1:44:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就忘了你是站在哪一边的了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you just completely forget what team you're playing for?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.22,1:44:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克 还有时间挽回局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker, there is time to salvage the situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.80,1:44:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帕克 - 闭上你的鸟嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Parker… - Shut your pie hole!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.39,1:44:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然怎样 脍子手 你要对我开枪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what, Ranger Rick? You gonna shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.68,1:44:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以那样做 - 你需要管好你的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I could do that. - You need to muzzle your dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.52,1:44:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都静一静好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, can we just take this down a couple of notches, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.36,1:44:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说要保障你的人都活着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you want to keep your people alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.90,1:44:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,先听听她的说法吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You start by listening to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.03,1:44:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些树对于奥玛蒂卡亚族人来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those trees were sacred to the Omaticaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.41,1:44:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你无法想像的那种神圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a way you can't imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.76,1:44:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.24,1:44:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好比是拿根木杖对天空挥两下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You throw a stick in the air around here,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.62,1:44:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就会降下什么鬼圣物这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's gonna land on some sacred fern,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.70,1:45:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天 - 我说的不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- for Christ's sake! - I'm not talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.12,1:45:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些灵异的巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}about some kind of pagan voodoo here. I'm talking about something real,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.63,1:45:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是真实存在的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}something measurable in the biology of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.80,1:45:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来解释生物与森林之间的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something measurable in the biology of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.38,1:45:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那到底是什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.92,1:45:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我们所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we think we know.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.30,1:45:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在树与树根之间都有着某种\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that there is some kind of electrochemical communication.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.76,1:45:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似电流的讯息传递\N{\fnArial\fs30}between the roots of the trees,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.97,1:45:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像神经细胞组织那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the synapses between neurons.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.27,1:45:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一棵树之间都有着成千成万个不同的连结点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And each tree has ten-to-the-fourth connections to the trees around it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.94,1:45:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘多拉星球有上亿万棵树\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there are ten-to-the-twelfth trees on Pandora.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.98,1:45:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想就是指这里有很多树\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is a lot, I'm guessing.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.32,1:45:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这比人脑还要复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more connections than the human brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.91,1:45:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗 这像是一种网路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it? It's a network.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.49,1:45:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种全球网路 纳威人可以登录进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a global network, and the Na'vi can access it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.62,1:45:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以上传和下载讯息 甚至储存\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can upload and download data. Memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.17,1:45:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚毁掉的就是一个网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}At sites like the one you just destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.50,1:45:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.80,1:45:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底在外面嗑了什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell have you people been smoking out there?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.55,1:45:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不过只是一些该死的树而已！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just goddamn trees!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.39,1:45:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克 你要搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to wake up, Parker.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.79,1:46:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你才给我搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You need to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.18,1:46:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个星球的资源不是在地下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wealth of this world isn't in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.05,1:46:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是在我们的周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all around us.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.77,1:46:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威人知道这一点 他们会誓死捍卫它\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Na'vi know that, and they are fighting to defend it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.57,1:46:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想跟他们共同享有这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to share this world with them,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.49,1:46:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就要去了解他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need to understand them.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.95,1:46:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说 我们已经了解得够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say we understand them just fine,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.03,1:46:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还真得多亏了杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks to Jake here.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.37,1:46:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 博士 过来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Doc, come take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.91,1:46:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们绝不会放弃他们的家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not gonna give up their home.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.96,1:46:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会接受任何条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not gonna make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.67,1:46:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要什么 清淡啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what? Lite beer?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.55,1:46:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝色牛仔裤？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And blue jeans?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.34,1:46:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们根本就不需要我们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing that we have that they want.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.14,1:46:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所做的一切根本是在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything they sent me out here to do is a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.11,1:46:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们绝不会离开家园树的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're never gonna leave Hometree.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.40,1:46:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然达不成协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, since a deal can't be made,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.98,1:47:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这事就变得简单多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess things get real simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.62,1:47:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 谢了 我真的很兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, thanks. I'm getting all emotional.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.16,1:47:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,兴奋到我都想给你一个热吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might just give you a big wet kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.48,1:47:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说一下状况 莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me, Lyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.53,1:47:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他们首先是用女妖翼兽来进攻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like they hit it with banshees first.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.20,1:47:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那个角被浸透过没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the angle's steep?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.12,1:47:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们放火烧了AMP装甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}They set the ampsuit on fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.50,1:47:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶员成烤土豆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driver's toast.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.21,1:47:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他队员呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of the squad?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.13,1:47:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,6具尸体 全都在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six bodies. That's all of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.51,1:47:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,设备损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}The equipment's totaled.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.55,1:48:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.18,1:48:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽量把伤害降到最低\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it with minimal casualties to the indigenous.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.44,1:48:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会先用催泪瓦斯把他们给赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll drive them out with gas first.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.19,1:48:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这应该会人道一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be humane.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.40,1:48:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}More or less.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.57,1:48:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 开始干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.87,1:48:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点准备好 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, people. Let's get it packed, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.58,1:48:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你知道的 他从来都没想过我们会成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, they never even wanted us to succeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.58,1:48:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们故意用推土机去铲别人的圣地\N{\fnArial\fs30}They bulldozed a sacred site on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.02,1:48:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,惹毛别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to trigger a response.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.21,1:48:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后编造借口 发动战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just fabricating this war.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.75,1:48:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,去得到他们想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get what they want.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.51,1:48:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,掠夺就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.18,1:48:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,当别人拥有你想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}When people are sitting on shit that you want,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.56,1:48:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就视他们为敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you make them your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.32,1:48:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后顺理成章的把东西抢过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're justified in taking it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.69,1:48:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,夸奇上校刚刚召集了武装直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quaritch is rolling the gunships.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.89,1:48:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要去攻击家园树\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna hit Hometree.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.07,1:48:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.53,1:49:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥古斯汀博士 你不能到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Augustine! You cannot be up here!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.01,1:49:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.79,1:49:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克 等等 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker. Wait. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.86,1:49:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是人 你却要\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are people you're about to…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.58,1:49:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 - 我叫你走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No, no, no, no. - I said back off!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.75,1:49:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是一群浑身叮满苍蝇住在树上的野蛮人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're fly-bitten savages that live in a tree!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.25,1:49:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗 看看四周\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? Look around!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.05,1:49:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太清楚你是怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about you,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.44,1:49:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我看到了很多很多的树 他们可以搬走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I see a lot of trees! They can move!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.84,1:49:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些家伙能不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you guys just please…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.79,1:49:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 首长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.39,1:49:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,家园树里有很多家庭 有小孩 有婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are families in there. There are children. Babies.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.97,1:49:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杀小孩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna kill children?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.35,1:49:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会真的想这么做 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want that kind of blood on your hands. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.35,1:49:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我去说服他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me try to talk them out.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.56,1:49:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.32,1:49:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点准备 我们立刻出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calibrate fast. We're going in, right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.82,1:49:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,三号 四号就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calibrating three and four.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.82,1:49:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 启动程序 - 倒数三十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run sequence. - Initiating. Thirty seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.16,1:49:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我给你一个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. You've got one hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.96,1:49:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不想让你的女朋友一起陪葬的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you want your girlfriend in there when the ax comes down,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.63,1:49:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就叫他们赶紧滚蛋 就一个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get them to evacuate. One hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.34,1:50:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.64,1:50:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.68,1:50:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃图康 我有话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eytukan, I have something to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.02,1:50:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,请听他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.48,1:50:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧 杰克·萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak, Jakesully.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.31,1:50:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,灾难就要降临了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great evil is upon us…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.61,1:50:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天空人正往这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sky People are coming…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.73,1:50:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁家园树\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to destroy Hometree.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.70,1:50:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们 天空人马上就要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, tell them they're gonna be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.70,1:50:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家不离开就会没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to leave, or you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.54,1:50:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you certain of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.29,1:50:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们派我来学习你们的文化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, they sent me here to learn your ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.17,1:50:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,以便有一天我可以传达这个讯息的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}so one day I could bring this message.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.58,1:50:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们才会相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that you would believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.01,1:50:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying, Jake?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.91,1:50:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早就知道会发生这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew this would happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.85,1:50:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.40,1:51:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 一开始我只是奉命行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, at first it was just orders,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.36,1:51:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但后来 一切都变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then everything changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.74,1:51:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 我爱上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I fell in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.20,1:51:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱上了这片森林 爱上了奥玛蒂卡亚族人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fell in love with the forest and with the Omaticaya people.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.66,1:51:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.08,1:51:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我当初信任你 - 我爱上了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I trusted you. - With you. With you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.00,1:51:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是那么的相信你 - 请你现在相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I trusted you! - Trust me now, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.22,1:51:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远不会成为我们的一分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never be one of The People!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.72,1:51:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不应该 - 我们试着阻止他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I shouldn't have… - We tried to stop them!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.60,1:51:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妮特丽 别这样 - 永远不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neytiri, please! Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.56,1:51:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们绑起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bind them.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.36,1:51:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave now!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.65,1:51:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须离开 他们就要到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to go. They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.83,1:52:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟后抵达目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time on target, one mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.09,1:52:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 目标进入视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy. We have a visual.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.13,1:52:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 保持航向 方位0-3-0\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that. Stay on heading 030.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.26,1:52:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 方位0-3-0\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, 030.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.40,1:52:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赶快逃进森林里去 - 他们快到了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run to the forest! - They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.07,1:52:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会摧毁这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will destroy this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.91,1:52:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮特丽 你得立刻离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neytiri, you must go now!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.66,1:52:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快逃进森林里去 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run to the forest! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.33,1:52:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.67,1:52:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要犹豫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.19,1:53:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 该死的 快走啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! God damn it, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.15,1:53:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,骑上伊卡兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the ikran…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.69,1:53:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,从空中发动攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}…attack from above.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.53,1:53:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是他妈的一颗大树\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is one big damn tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.25,1:53:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这个 看来我们的谈判失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well. I'd say diplomacy has failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.42,1:53:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 各位 开工吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, people, let's get this done!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.59,1:53:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要所有的催泪瓦斯弹都对准了入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want every gas round you got right in the front door.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.51,1:53:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解 CS.40催泪瓦斯弹准备发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger. CS.40's going hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.93,1:53:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开火 - 发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fire. - Firing.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.57,1:53:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,中了 你真是神枪手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo. Mighty good shooting, ace.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.53,1:54:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 他们开火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, they've opened fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.08,1:54:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是在开玩笑的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.39,1:54:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些野蛮人怎么还搞不清楚状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}These dumb bastardsain't getting the message.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.97,1:54:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们一点颜色瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's turn up the heat.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.72,1:54:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 改用燃烧弹！ - 改用燃烧弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Switch incendiaries! - Switching incendiaries.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.73,1:54:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.15,1:54:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.45,1:54:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快到森林里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get everyone to the forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.58,1:54:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,蟑螂就是这么驱散的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's how you scatter the roaches.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.55,1:54:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮特丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neytiri!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.43,1:55:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得想办法离开 他们要炸掉树干了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta move! He's gonna blow the columns!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.56,1:55:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.41,1:55:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莫娅 不要！ - 如果你是我们的一分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mo'at! No! - If you are one of us,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.29,1:55:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你帮帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.39,1:55:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位 改用导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}All call signs, switch missiles.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.56,1:55:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把导弹都给我对准西边树干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me HE's at the base of the west columns.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.93,1:55:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.31,1:55:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,骑士小队改用导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rider section, switch missiles.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.27,1:55:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一号准备完成 - 二号完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One's good. - Two's rocks up.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.32,1:55:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三号完成 - 耶 尝尝这个！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Three's up. - Yeah, baby, get some!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.40,1:55:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥机 战机待命中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie Oscar, Gunrunner standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.74,1:56:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把它轰垮 - 准许发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bring it down. - Cleared hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.20,1:56:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝 快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Grace, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.42,1:56:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 快趴下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down! Head down!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.59,1:56:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on! Down!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.60,1:56:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 命中 - 确实命中目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Solid hits. - Solid rocks on target.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.68,1:56:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw this.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.10,1:56:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉！ 你在搞什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.19,1:56:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是为了干这种混账事来这里的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't sign up for this shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.66,1:56:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 火力全开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat. Ripple fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.08,1:57:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！ 快！ 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.74,1:58:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 回来 回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, get back! Back!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.21,1:58:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on, move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.80,1:59:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 各位 今晚的庆功宴算我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good work, people. First round's on me tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.10,1:59:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体回航吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's boogie.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.77,1:59:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞龙突击艇左转弯 返航回基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragon coming left, heading home.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.65,1:59:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,炮艇机左转弯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunrunner coming left.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.65,1:59:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雷电小队收到 - 骑士小队收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thunder copies. - Rider section copies.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.78,1:59:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.72,1:59:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daughter…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.22,1:59:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着 我的 弓箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}take… my… bow.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.43,2:00:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护族人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect The People.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.28,2:00:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮特丽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neytiri!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.58,2:00:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 对不起 - 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. I'm sorry. - Get away.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.96,2:00:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我滚开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.34,2:00:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远远的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from here!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.55,2:00:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远别再回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never come back!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.82,2:00:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,把机器停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull the plug.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.95,2:00:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能！ 不 你不能这么做！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.86,2:00:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这么做！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.62,2:00:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷静！ 冷静下来！ - 不！ 拜托！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Calm down! Calm down! - No! Please!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.80,2:01:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原本梦想成为带来和平的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a warrior who dreamed he could bring peace.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.77,2:01:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但很残酷的是 你终究必须回到现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later, though, you always have to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.48,2:01:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.78,2:01:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他放下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him down!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.74,2:01:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个杀人凶手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You murderer!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.13,2:02:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,过得如何啊 兄弟 好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on, brother? Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.30,2:02:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.72,2:02:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我个人认为这些环保叛徒根本没资格享受牛排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personally, I don't feel these tree-hugging traitors deserve steak.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.51,2:02:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛排 太扯了 让我瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get steak? That's bullshit. Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.89,2:02:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么 趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You know what that is. Down.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.52,2:02:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 楚迪 - 五体投地\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Trudy! - All the way down.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.44,2:02:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.74,2:03:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚迪 发动直升机！ 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trudy, fire up the ship! Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.83,2:03:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.01,2:03:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安全 快走 - 给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clear. Come on. - Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.03,2:03:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯 你留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max, stay here.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.01,2:03:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一个能信任的内应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need someone on the inside I can trust.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.99,2:03:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Go.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.09,2:03:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.22,2:03:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.51,2:04:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校？ 长官？ 我这里有状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel? Sir? I got a situation here.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.93,2:04:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,大力神1-6号未经许可擅自启动引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Samson 1-6. Unauthorized engine start.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.02,2:04:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,三！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.15,2:04:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.32,2:04:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上滤气面罩！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mask on!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.24,2:04:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有毒气 有毒气 有毒气！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas, gas, gas!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.70,2:04:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在向我们开火！ 快点走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking fire! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.21,2:04:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住我的手！ 快 大家都进来了 我们走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab my hand! Come on, we're in. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.34,2:04:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快走 快走！ 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go! Let's go, go!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.81,2:04:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.86,2:04:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耶！ 耶！ - 太好了！ 漂亮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! Yeah! - All right! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.61,2:05:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 狗屎 - 大家都还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crap. - Everybody all right back there?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.37,2:05:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是的 宝贝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, baby!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.91,2:05:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 诺姆 你呢？ - 没问题！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Norm, you good? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:09.71,2:05:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒霉 我挨了一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna ruin my whole day.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:12.29,2:05:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格蕾丝中弹了！ - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grace is hit! - What?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.21,2:05:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快拿急救箱 - 急救箱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get the trauma kit. - Trauma kit!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.88,2:05:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,压住伤口 格蕾丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the pressure on, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:18.63,2:05:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,急救箱在前面的舱壁上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trauma kit's forward, on the bulkhead.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.47,2:05:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格蕾丝 撑着点 - 不要紧 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hang on, Grace. - Doesn't matter. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.31,2:05:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以了 - 吊起来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're good to go. - Take it up!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.94,2:05:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,站稳了 我开始起吊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. I'm pulling pitch.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.19,2:05:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're clear!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:47.58,2:05:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直向北飞 到深山里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep going north. Get us deep in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.41,2:05:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.80,2:06:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺姆 你那里还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norm, you all good up there?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:00.85,2:06:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep! Still here.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.97,2:06:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他们无法跟踪我们到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least they can't track us up here.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.66,2:06:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少到不了电磁旋涡这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this far into the Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.72,2:06:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂树一带最强烈 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's strongest at the Tree of Souls, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.85,2:06:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:12.43,2:06:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 我们就去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. 'Cause that's where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.24,2:06:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.78,2:06:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个大孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You big baby.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.58,2:06:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're moving.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.58,2:06:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就去找人救你 格蕾丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you some help, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.58,2:06:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是科学家 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a scientist, remember?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.67,2:06:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信童话故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe in fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.96,2:06:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会治好你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The People can help you.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:44.34,2:06:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.64,2:06:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么要帮我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they help us?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.53,2:07:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威人说 艾娃会保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The People say Eywa will provide.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.58,2:07:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有家园 没有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}With no home, no hope,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:14.33,2:07:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就只剩下一个地方可以去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was only one place they could go.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.93,2:07:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Link's running.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.85,2:07:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 你有什么计划？ - 我没有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the plan here, Jake? - There's no plan.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.89,2:07:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏泰现在是酋长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tsu'tey is Olo'eyktan now.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.12,2:07:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是不会让你接近那里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna let you near that place.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.52,2:07:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总得试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta try.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.70,2:07:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launching.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.51,2:08:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,放逐者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outcast.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:11.51,2:08:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betrayer.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.85,2:08:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alien.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.56,2:08:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里 没有任何地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in the place the eye does not see.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:30.45,2:08:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要彼此的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed their help, and they needed mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.24,2:08:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要再度面对他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to ever face them again,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:37.29,2:08:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须重新改变他们对我的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna have to take it to a whole new level.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.34,2:08:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,人这一辈子有时就得靠一次疯狂的举动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes your whole life boils down to one insane move.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.43,2:08:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去做一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something we gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.89,2:08:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定不会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna like it.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.61,2:09:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为 托鲁克是天上最可怕的飞兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I had it figured, Toruk is the baddest cat in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.49,2:09:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人敢攻击它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing attacks him.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.66,2:09:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, boy.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:16.45,2:09:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以它怎么会往上看呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why would he ever look up?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.41,2:09:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 这只是我的猜测\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was just a theory.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.74,2:10:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,魅影骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toruk Macto?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:13.15,2:11:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感受到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I See you.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:17.74,2:11:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感受到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I See you.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.37,2:11:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很害怕 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.50,2:11:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我的族人担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my people.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.05,2:11:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我不再害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:46.10,2:11:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏泰 阿特尤之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tsu'tey, son of Ateyo…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:49.06,2:11:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我站在你面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I stand before you…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.11,2:11:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时准备为奥玛蒂卡亚族效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}…ready to serve the Omaticaya people.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:57.86,2:12:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是酋长 也是位伟大的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Olo'eyktan, and you are a great warrior.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:03.29,2:12:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你我办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this without you.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:12.50,2:12:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,魅影骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toruk Macto,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:21.76,2:12:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意和你一起飞翔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will fly with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.81,2:12:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend is dying.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:30.94,2:12:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace is dying.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.48,2:12:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请求艾娃帮助她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg the help of Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:48.25,2:12:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们在哪里 格蕾丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look where we are, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:56.96,2:12:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得采集一些样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to take some samples.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:22.78,2:13:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾娃也许会选择保存她的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Great Mother may choose to save all that she is.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.08,2:13:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,转移到这个身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this body.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:32.08,2:13:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有可能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:33.83,2:13:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她必须通过艾娃之眼的考验 然后再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must pass through the eye of Eywa and return.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:39.59,2:13:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 杰克·萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Jakesully,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:42.13,2:13:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她非常虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}she is very weak.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:45.22,2:13:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 格蕾丝 他们会把你治好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, Grace. They're gonna fix you up.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:51.23,2:13:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,万灵之母 请倾听我们的祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear us please, All Mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:54.40,2:13:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救她吧 艾娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eywa, help her.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:57.40,2:13:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们请您接收这个灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this spirit into you…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:03.15,2:14:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她重回我们身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and breathe her back to us.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.20,2:14:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她的生命得以延续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her walk among us…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.37,2:14:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,以一个真正纳威人的身份活在我们之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as one of The People.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:44.28,2:14:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.78,2:14:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:51.08,2:14:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到艾娃了 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with her, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.79,2:14:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是真的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's real!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:59.21,2:15:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝？ 格蕾丝 别 格蕾丝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace? Grace, please. Grace!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:03.55,2:15:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.13,2:15:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.14,2:15:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:14.02,2:15:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾丝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:17.27,2:15:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:25.15,2:15:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有用吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.24,2:15:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的伤势太严重了 已经太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her wounds were too great. It was not enough time.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.00,2:15:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟艾娃在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is with Eywa now.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:13.54,2:16:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你允许 我现在有话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your permission, I will speak now.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:18.58,2:16:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,恳请你为我翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would honor me by translating.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:28.13,2:16:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,天空人传达一个信息给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sky People have sent us a message.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:33.72,2:16:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they can take whatever they want.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:37.93,2:16:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,任谁都阻止不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no one can stop them.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:43.31,2:16:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们要传达一个信息给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we will send them a message.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.74,2:16:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将御风飞翔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ride out as fast as the wind can carry you.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:53.37,2:16:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将集合全部的部落一同作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell the other clans to come.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:58.87,2:17:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们魅影骑士在召唤他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell them Toruk Macto calls to them.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:03.59,2:17:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就出发！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you fly now with me!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:07.42,2:17:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的兄弟们 姐妹们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brothers! Sisters!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.01,2:17:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要让天空人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will show the Sky People.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.10,2:17:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不可以为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they cannot take whatever they want,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.47,2:17:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这里是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that this,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:19.64,2:17:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的家园！\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is our land!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:27.78,2:17:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yah!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:44.33,2:17:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yah!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:15.16,2:18:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yah!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:34.05,2:18:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走遍世界各地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We rode out to the four winds.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:38.30,2:18:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在平原上找到了马族部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the horse clans of the plain.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.69,2:18:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们赶回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to the stars!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:44.81,2:18:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,到东海岸边找到了伊卡兰族\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the ikran people ofthe Eastern Sea.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:47.06,2:18:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我们的子孙后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}For our children's children!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.44,2:18:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,魅影骑士的召唤让所有人团结在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Toruk Macto called them, they came.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:54.86,2:18:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yah!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:32.40,2:19:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个基地的每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone on this base, every one of you,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:34.99,2:19:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在为生存努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}is fighting for survival.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:36.90,2:19:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不争的事实！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a fact!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:39.24,2:19:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在外面有一大群纳威人正在集结\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an aboriginal horde out there.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:42.28,2:19:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}massing for an attack.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:44.08,2:19:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据卫星照片显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, these orbital images tell me.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:48.37,2:19:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些纳威人 一天之内就从几百人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the hostiles' numbers have gone from a few hundred.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.63,2:19:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,增加到两千多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to well over 2, 000 in one day.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:54.76,2:19:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且人数还在增加当中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And more are pouring in.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:59.22,2:20:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一周后 将会达到两万人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a week's time, there could be 20, 000 of them.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:02.72,2:20:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时 他们会冲破我们的外围防线\N{\fnArial\fs30}At that point, they will overrun our perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:05.10,2:20:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不会让这种事情发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's not gonna happen!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:08.94,2:20:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们唯一的办法就是先发制人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our only security lies in pre-emptive attack.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.61,2:20:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将以其人之道还治其人之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will fight terror with terror.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:19.32,2:20:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些纳威人相信他们的家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the hostiles believe that this mountain stronghold of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.58,2:20:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,受到了他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is protected by their…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:26.00,2:20:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的神灵保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their deity.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:28.71,2:20:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么当我们摧毁它的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when we destroy it,
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.83,2:20:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在他们的记忆里深深的烙上一个教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will blast a crater in their racial memory so deep.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:33.29,2:20:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们永远再也不敢接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they won't come.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:34.97,2:20:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这里方圆一千公里的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}within 1, 000 klicks of this place ever again.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:36.88,2:20:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这件事也将成为不变的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that, too, is a fact.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.30,2:20:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:52.52,2:20:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 这里很夸张 几乎全体总动员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, it's crazy here. It's full mobilization.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:55.00,2:20:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要把飞行器变成轰炸机\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're rigging the shuttle as a bomber.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:56.57,2:20:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在运输船上装满了大堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got these huge pallets.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:57.74,2:20:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来炸矿坑用专用的炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}of mine explosives.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:58.90,2:21:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备用来摧毁什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for some kind of shock-and-awe campaign.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:01.91,2:21:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人全都疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fricking daisy cutters!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:05.33,2:21:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,夸奇上校接管一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quaritch has taken over.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:06.30,2:21:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在全部都听他号令 谁也没办法阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's rolling, and there's no stopping him.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:08.25,2:21:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么时候开始！ - 明天早上六点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When? - 06:00 tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:10.42,2:21:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克斯！ 麦克斯！ - 我不能再说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Max! Max! - I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:14.17,2:21:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们玩完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:17.13,2:21:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原先还以为能有个什么计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was hoping for some sort of tactical plan.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:19.38,2:21:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够全身而退的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that didn't involve martyrdom.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:23.09,2:21:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要用弓箭对抗武装飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going up against gunships with bows and arrows.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:29.48,2:21:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在外面有十五个部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have 15 clans out there.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:32.19,2:21:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,超过两千名战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's over 2, 000 warriors.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:35.82,2:21:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们清楚这些山的地形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we know these mountains.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:37.54,2:21:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都清楚 你也清楚 但他们不熟悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fly them. You fly them. They don't.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:41.32,2:21:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的电子设备在这里不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their instruments won't work up here.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.75,2:21:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动追踪导弹也没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missile tracking won't work.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:45.87,2:21:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只能手动瞄准\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll have to fire a line of sight.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:47.45,2:21:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们攻过来 我们就有地形上的优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they bring the fight to us, then we have the home-field advantage.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:53.58,2:21:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他肯定会直接轰炸灵魂之树的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he's gonna commit that bomber straight to the Tree of Souls.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:57.13,2:21:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:58.38,2:22:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果让他们到达那里 那就玩完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they get to the Tree of Souls, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:01.01,2:22:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是纳威人跟艾娃 他们先灵联系的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's their direct line to Eywa, their ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:05.01,2:22:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会毁了纳威人意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:07.05,2:22:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们最好别让他们得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I guess we'd better stop him.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:24.57,2:22:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能只是在和一棵树说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm probably just talking to a tree right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:29.99,2:22:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果您真的在那里 我必须提醒您\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you're there, I need to give you a heads-up.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:37.29,2:22:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果格蕾丝和您在一起 请您看一看她的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Grace is with you, look into her memories.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:42.97,2:22:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们来的那个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the world we come from.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:46.18,2:22:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里已经没有绿色的大地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no green there.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:49.47,2:22:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们亲手杀死了自己的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed their Mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:52.27,2:22:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们要在这里做同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're gonna do the same here.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:56.40,2:22:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,更多的天空人会来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}More Sky People are gonna come.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:59.07,2:23:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只会越来越多 而且永远不会停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna come like a rain that never ends.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:03.40,2:23:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我们能阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless we stop them.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:07.74,2:23:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道您选择了我是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you chose me for something.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:12.29,2:23:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会奋起抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will stand and fight.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:15.21,2:23:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,您知道我会这样做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I will.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:19.29,2:23:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我真的需要您的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need a little help here.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:27.68,2:23:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾娃是不会偏袒任何一边的 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Great Mother does not take sides, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:32.52,2:23:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只维护生态的平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}She protects only the balance of life.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:47.78,2:23:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总得试一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:20.19,2:24:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！ 对！ 这就是我要的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Yeah! That's what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:22.23,2:24:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！ 对！ 这就是我要的 伙计！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Yeah! That's what I'm talking about, man!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:37.71,2:24:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是指挥机 我们将进入电磁漩涡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Group Leader. We are entering the Flux Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:41.46,2:24:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,切换到手动飞行模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch to manual flight mode.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:43.25,2:24:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 手动飞行模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy. Manual flight mode.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:19.96,2:25:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是总指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Papa Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:21.92,2:25:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要这次任务速战速决 我赶着回家吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want this mission high and tight. I want to be home for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:32.51,2:25:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,机甲小组 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit Team, go.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:33.99,2:25:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 姑娘们 给他们好看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, ladies, let's bring the pain!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:46.82,2:25:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动 行动 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:54.07,2:25:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,B1-1 向左移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo 1-1, move left.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:56.41,2:25:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,B1-1 向左移动 注意侧翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo 1-1 moving left. Watch flank.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:02.16,2:26:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保持队形 继续前进 - 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch formation. Keep moving. - Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:05.79,2:26:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,C2-1 注意保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie 2-1, watch your spacing.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:08.30,2:26:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. Over.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:09.67,2:26:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上面 注意上方 注意热能雷达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes up. Check that overhead. And watch those thermal scans.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:14.97,2:26:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫所有单位 指挥官在领队发令\N{\fnArial\fs30}All call signs, Papa has lead,
Dialogue: 0,2:26:17.54,2:26:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,向目标推进\N{\fnArial\fs30}pushing to target.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:18.35,2:26:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,护卫机 紧紧跟着我的航天飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Escorts, stay close on my shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:25.90,2:26:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这我们难免有点小磕碰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are gonna lose some paint in here.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:29.40,2:26:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,机枪小组 注意山边峭壁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun crews, keep your head on a swivel.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:32.15,2:26:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别大意 各位 他们就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make no mistake, people, they're out there.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:36.66,2:26:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 各位 目标出现 距离四公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, people, target in sight. Range, four klicks.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:39.99,2:26:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,女战神1-6号 准备投弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valkyrie 1-6, get your payload ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:42.33,2:26:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解 准备发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy. Prepare to offload.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:43.69,2:26:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,参谋中士 炸弹就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staff Sergeant, stage the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:45.62,2:26:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,推到舷梯上！快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roll it to the ramp! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:50.09,2:26:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,停！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:59.18,2:27:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,C2-1 动作快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie 2-1, got big movement.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:01.31,2:27:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保持不动 - 等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold position. - Hold up, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:02.81,2:27:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,五百米处有动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got movement out there, 500 meters.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:04.89,2:27:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,C2-1 保持不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie 2-1, hold position.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:13.07,2:27:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 地面有状况 正在快速接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, ground has movement! Fast approaching.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:16.07,2:27:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 指挥机 这是骑士小队 - 成射击阵型！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Charlie Oscar, Rider section. - Firing line!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:19.03,2:27:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标接近中 距离四百米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Targets closing. Range, 400 meters.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:22.45,2:27:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把这个弄清楚点吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you clean it up?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:23.74,2:27:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 长官 有电磁波干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. It's the Flux.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:53.48,2:27:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 我杀条路进去 你跟在我后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, I'm gonna punch a hole. You follow me through.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:37.90,2:28:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有战机 自主射击！自主射击！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All aircraft, weapons free! Weapons free!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:41.78,2:28:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,右转 掉头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break right. Come around.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:46.54,2:28:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,轰掉他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light them up!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:55.67,2:28:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,分散队形 全面攻击敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break formation, engage all hostiles.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:05.14,2:29:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃我子弹吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Get some!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:46.01,2:29:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝎子炮艇机 扫荡敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scorpions, pursue and destroy.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:58.69,2:30:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克？杰克 听得到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake! Jake! You copy?
Dialogue: 0,2:30:01.15,2:30:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要撤退了！敌人火力太猛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're falling back! We're getting hammered!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:03.86,2:30:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 赶快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy. Get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:10.04,2:30:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他 快给我追！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him. Get after him!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:28.39,2:30:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:38.19,2:30:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她轰了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light her up!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:48.66,2:30:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她轰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:50.20,2:30:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是只有你才有枪 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the only one with a gun, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:52.71,2:30:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看住她 - 全部瞄准她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep her in your sights. - Purging. Feeding the leak.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:54.42,2:30:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,全力攻击她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arming all pods.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:01.21,2:31:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像话！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:32.95,2:31:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,西子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seyzey!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:38.02,2:32:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,淘气鬼一号中弹 我要返航了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogue One is hit. I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:41.15,2:32:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:59.58,2:33:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:18.77,2:33:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏泰 兄弟 你听得到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tsu'tey! Brother, do you read?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:24.11,2:33:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,淘气鬼一号 你收得到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogue One, you copy?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:27.78,2:33:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trudy!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:39.83,2:33:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分钟后抵达目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to target, two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:41.46,2:33:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,女战神1-6号 障碍已清除 准备开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valkyrie 1-6, you are cleared and hot.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:43.96,2:33:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 飞龙号 开始投弹程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, Dragon. We are starting our bomb run.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:51.97,2:33:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号弹 解除保险！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arm number one!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:54.03,2:33:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号弹 保险已解除！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number one armed!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:57.18,2:33:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma Jake!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:00.35,2:34:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read you.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:10.65,2:34:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妮特丽 - 西子死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Neytiri! - Seyzey's dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:13.24,2:34:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人离得很近 人非常多\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are very close. They are many.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:17.16,2:34:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not attack.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:19.24,2:34:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗？妮特丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you read me, Neytiri?
Dialogue: 0,2:34:23.79,2:34:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not attack!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:25.42,2:34:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点撤退 现在就离开 这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back now. Get out of there! That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:36.68,2:34:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮特丽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neytiri!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:39.97,2:34:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,前方有动静 有动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got movement, I got movement.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:41.98,2:34:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在原地 有东西来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold position. Something's coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:44.31,2:34:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,B1-1 有很大的感应 注意屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo 1-1, I got a big seating.Turn screens over.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:46.19,2:34:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西靠近了 距离两百米\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got movement 200 meters.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:47.85,2:34:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持队形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your formation.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:48.40,2:34:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好 - 注意侧翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be ready. - Watch your flanks.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:55.28,2:34:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离一百米 快速接近中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hundred meters and closing fast.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:13.34,2:35:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,2:35:22.72,2:35:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 撤退！撤退！- 快撤！快撤！快撤！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fall back! Fall back! - Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,2:35:24.52,2:35:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退！快跑！快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back! On the run! On the run!
Dialogue: 0,2:35:34.07,2:35:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 艾娃听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake, Eywa has heard you.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:43.66,2:35:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾娃听到你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eywa has heard you!
Dialogue: 0,2:35:56.01,2:35:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:09.69,2:36:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退！快撤！快撤！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:36.05,2:36:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 护卫机不是被击落就是正在撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir! All escorts are down or falling back.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:38.76,2:36:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来结束这一切吧 飞龙号呼叫女战神1-6号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this done. Valkyrie 1-6, this is Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:42.97,2:36:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 强攻目标 - 收到 强攻目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Press to target. - Copy. Pressing to target.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:45.89,2:36:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,投弹倒计时三十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by to drop, 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:07.75,2:37:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我指令 二 一 投弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my mark. Two, one, mark.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:10.25,2:37:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,投弹！ 投弹！ 投弹！ 快 快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop! Drop! Drop! Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,2:37:12.58,2:37:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,投弹！ 投弹！ 投弹！ 快 快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop! Drop! Drop! Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,2:37:46.74,2:37:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,顶住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brace!
Dialogue: 0,2:38:04.93,2:38:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sully.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:19.99,2:38:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戴上滤气面罩！ - 破裂警报！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mask on! - Breach alarm!
Dialogue: 0,2:41:06.65,2:41:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 到爸爸这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come to papa.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:35.97,2:41:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,投降吧！ 夸奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it up, Quaritch!
Dialogue: 0,2:41:40.81,2:41:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:43.56,2:41:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有一口气在就不会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's over while I'm breathing.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:46.11,2:41:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话正合我意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of hoped you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:44.54,2:42:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:43:01.64,2:43:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 萨利 背叛自己的种族感觉怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sully, how's it feel to betray your own race?
Dialogue: 0,2:43:10.40,2:43:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为你是他们的一份子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're one of them?
Dialogue: 0,2:43:13.82,2:43:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,该醒来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:59.68,2:45:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake?
Dialogue: 0,2:45:14.44,2:45:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:33.54,2:45:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:50.98,2:45:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 我的杰克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake! Ma Jake!
Dialogue: 0,2:46:34.65,2:46:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I See you.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:41.57,2:46:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I See you.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:08.01,2:47:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受到你 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I See you, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:10.43,2:47:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,族人安全了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are The People safe?
Dialogue: 0,2:47:14.48,2:47:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're safe.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:22.11,2:47:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't…
Dialogue: 0,2:47:24.78,2:47:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能领导他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot lead The People.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:27.57,2:47:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必需要领导他们 杰克萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must lead them… Jakesully.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:31.29,2:47:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是当首领的料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not officer material.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:33.29,2:47:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是注定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is decided.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:38.38,2:47:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,2:47:40.80,2:47:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成奥玛蒂卡亚族该做的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…do the duty of Olo'eyktan.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:47.80,2:47:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会杀你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not kill you.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:49.51,2:47:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the way!
Dialogue: 0,2:47:53.47,2:47:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这对于我来说是最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is good.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:57.31,2:47:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会永远记得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be remembered.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:01.77,2:48:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我与…魅影骑士一起战斗过！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fought… with Toruk Macto!
Dialogue: 0,2:48:08.32,2:48:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们还是兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we were brothers.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:11.62,2:48:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是…我曾经的最终幻影\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he… was my last shadow.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:02.13,2:49:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人返回他们垂死的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}The aliens went back to their dying world.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:07.13,2:49:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有少数人被允许留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a few were chosen to stay.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:22.27,2:49:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,苦难的时代终于结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time of great sorrow was ending.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:26.86,2:49:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们不再需要魅影骑士了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toruk Macto was no longerneeded.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:41.83,2:49:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我想这应该是我最后一次的影像日记了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess this is my last video log.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:47.55,2:49:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为不论今晚发生什么 总之\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause whatever happens tonight, either way, I'm…
Dialogue: 0,2:49:52.39,2:49:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不会再回到这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna be coming back to this place.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:58.85,2:50:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess I'd better go.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:03.56,2:50:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想错过我的派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't want to be late for my own party.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:09.94,2:50:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟 今天是我的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's my birthday, after all.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:14.91,2:50:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是杰克·萨利 录影完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Jake Sully signing off.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:32.25,2:51:40.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《阿凡达》
Dialogue: 0,2:51:49.20,2:51:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Walking through a dream ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:51:52.42,2:51:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I see you ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:51:55.95,2:52:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ My light in darkness breathing hope of new life ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:02.50,2:52:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Now I live through you and you through me ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:06.84,2:52:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Enchanting ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:10.06,2:52:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I pray in my heart that this dream never end ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:18.13,2:52:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I see me through your eyes ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:26.76,2:52:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Living through life flying high ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:35.05,2:52:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Your life shines the way into paradise ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:42.06,2:52:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ So I offer my life ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:45.76,2:52:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I offer my love，for you ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:51.45,2:52:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ When my heart was never open ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:54.60,2:52:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ And my spirit never free ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:57.74,2:53:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ To the world that you have shown me ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:04.92,2:53:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ But my eyes could not division ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:09.96,2:53:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ All the colours of love and of life ever more ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:18.83,2:53:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Evermore（I see me through your eyes） ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:26.67,2:53:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I see me through your eyes（Living through life flying high） ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:33.15,2:53:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Flying high ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:36.74,2:53:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Your love shines the way into paradise ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:43.58,2:53:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ So I offer my life as a sacrifice ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:50.66,2:53:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ And live through your love ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:57.88,2:54:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ And live through your life ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:54:12.08,2:54:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I see you ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:54:18.83,2:54:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I see you ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:51:49.20,2:51:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 梦里穿行 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:51:52.42,2:51:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我见到了你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:51:55.95,2:52:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是我黑暗中的光芒 吐纳新生活的希望 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:02.50,2:52:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 于是我中有你 你中有我 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:06.84,2:52:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 就这么着了魔 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:10.06,2:52:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 从心底祈愿 沉醉梦里不愿醒 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:18.13,2:52:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 通过你的的眼睛 看到真实的自己 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:26.76,2:52:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 驰骋生活 朝天际飞去 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:35.05,2:52:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 而你照亮了通往天堂的轨迹 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:42.06,2:52:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 把我的生命交给你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:45.76,2:52:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 把我的爱 统统给你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:51.45,2:52:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我从未开启的心 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:54.60,2:52:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 从未自由的魂灵 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:52:57.74,2:53:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是你引领我步入新天地 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:04.92,2:53:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但我这凡胎肉眼 要怎么分辨 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:09.96,2:53:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这爱的色彩 这生命的斑斓 从今往后 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:18.83,2:53:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 直到永远（通过你的眼睛 看到真实的自己） ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:26.67,2:53:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 通过你的眼睛看到真实的自己（驰骋生活 朝天际飞去） ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:33.15,2:53:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 朝天际飞去 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:36.74,2:53:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 而你照亮了通往天堂的轨迹 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:43.58,2:53:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我愿把自己贡献成祭品 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:50.66,2:53:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 因你的爱 我才存在 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:53:57.88,2:54:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 因你的生命 我才存在 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:54:12.08,2:54:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我见到了你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:54:18.83,2:54:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我见到了你 ∮
